gateurs</strong>, et une <strong data-start=3D"326" data-end=3D"355">introd=
uction aux DevTools</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"358" data-end=3D"361">
<h1 data-start=3D"363" data-end=3D"427">=F0=9F=8C=90 Tutoriel =E2=80=94 Int=
roduction G=C3=A9n=C3=A9rale au Web (D=C3=A9butant =C3=A0 Expert)</h1>
<hr data-start=3D"429" data-end=3D"432">
<h2 data-start=3D"434" data-end=3D"469">1. =F0=9F=8C=8D Qu=E2=80=99est-ce q=
u=E2=80=99un site web ?</h2>
<p data-start=3D"471" data-end=3D"706">Un <strong data-start=3D"474" data-e=
nd=3D"486">site web</strong> est un ensemble de <strong data-start=3D"506" =
data-end=3D"519">pages web</strong>, souvent interconnect=C3=A9es entre ell=
es via des <strong data-start=3D"565" data-end=3D"586">liens hypertextes</s=
trong>, accessibles par une <strong data-start=3D"608" data-end=3D"625">adr=
esse (URL)</strong>, stock=C3=A9es sur un <strong data-start=3D"643" data-e=
nd=3D"658">serveur web</strong>, et rendues visibles via un <strong data-st=
art=3D"687" data-end=3D"705">navigateur web</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"708" data-end=3D"746">=E2=9C=85 Caract=C3=A9ristiques d=
=E2=80=99un site web :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"747" data-end=3D"1057">
<li data-start=3D"747" data-end=3D"823">
<p data-start=3D"749" data-end=3D"823">Il est <strong data-start=3D"756" da=
ta-end=3D"767">h=C3=A9berg=C3=A9</strong> sur un serveur (ordinateur connec=
t=C3=A9 =C3=A0 Internet 24h/24).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"824" data-end=3D"894">
<p data-start=3D"826" data-end=3D"894">Il est <strong data-start=3D"833" da=
ta-end=3D"848">consultable</strong> via un navigateur (Chrome, Firefox, Saf=
ari=E2=80=A6).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"895" data-end=3D"981">
<p data-start=3D"897" data-end=3D"981">Il est constitu=C3=A9 de <strong dat=
a-start=3D"917" data-end=3D"929">fichiers</strong> : HTML (structure), CSS =
(style), JS (comportement).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"982" data-end=3D"1057">
<p data-start=3D"984" data-end=3D"1057">Il poss=C3=A8de une <strong data-st=
art=3D"999" data-end=3D"1017">adresse unique</strong> : une URL (ex. : <cod=
e data-start=3D"1035" data-end=3D"1055">https://openai.com</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
