<h2 data-start=3D"1372" data-end=3D"1409">2. =F0=9F=95=B8=EF=B8=8F Comment =
fonctionne le Web ?</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1411" data-end=3D"1531">Le Web repose sur un <strong data-=
start=3D"1432" data-end=3D"1457">mod=C3=A8le client-serveur</strong> et uti=
lise un ensemble de technologies pour rendre les sites accessibles.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1533" data-end=3D"1577">2.1 =F0=9F=A7=91=E2=80=8D=F0=9F=
=92=BB Le mod=C3=A8le <strong data-start=3D"1557" data-end=3D"1577">client =
- serveur</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1579" data-end=3D"1738">
<li data-start=3D"1579" data-end=3D"1666">
<p data-start=3D"1581" data-end=3D"1666"><strong data-start=3D"1581" data-e=
nd=3D"1591">Client</strong> : c=E2=80=99est le <strong data-start=3D"1603" =
data-end=3D"1621">navigateur web</strong> (Chrome, Firefox) utilis=C3=A9 pa=
r un internaute.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1667" data-end=3D"1738">
<p data-start=3D"1669" data-end=3D"1738"><strong data-start=3D"1669" data-e=
nd=3D"1680">Serveur</strong> : c=E2=80=99est une machine qui <strong data-s=
tart=3D"1705" data-end=3D"1729">h=C3=A9berge les fichiers</strong> du site.=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1740" data-end=3D"1784">Quand tu tapes une URL dans ton na=
vigateur :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"1785" data-end=3D"2032">
<li data-start=3D"1785" data-end=3D"1862">
<p data-start=3D"1788" data-end=3D"1862">Le <strong data-start=3D"1791" dat=
a-end=3D"1801">client</strong> (ton navigateur) envoie une <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"1830" data-end=3D"1846">requ=C3=AAte HTTP</strong> au <strong data-st=
art=3D"1850" data-end=3D"1861">serveur</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1863" data-end=3D"1957">
<p data-start=3D"1866" data-end=3D"1957">Le <strong data-start=3D"1869" dat=
a-end=3D"1880">serveur</strong> traite cette requ=C3=AAte et envoie une <st=
rong data-start=3D"1916" data-end=3D"1927">r=C3=A9ponse</strong> : les fich=
iers HTML, CSS, JS=E2=80=A6</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1958" data-end=3D"2032">
<p data-start=3D"1961" data-end=3D"2032">Le navigateur <strong data-start=
=3D"1975" data-end=3D"2002">interpr=C3=A8te ces fichiers</strong> et affich=
e la page =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99=C3=A9cran.</p>
</li>
</ol>
