<hr data-start=3D"4364" data-end=3D"4367">
<h2 data-start=3D"4369" data-end=3D"4407">4. =F0=9F=A7=AD Le r=C3=B4le du <=
strong data-start=3D"4389" data-end=3D"4407">navigateur web</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4409" data-end=3D"4575">Un <strong data-start=3D"4412" dat=
a-end=3D"4430">navigateur web</strong> est un logiciel (Chrome, Firefox, Sa=
fari=E2=80=A6) qui <strong data-start=3D"4478" data-end=3D"4519">interpr=C3=
=A8te les fichiers HTML, CSS, JS</strong> re=C3=A7us depuis un serveur pour=
 <strong data-start=3D"4549" data-end=3D"4574">afficher une page web</stron=
g>.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4577" data-end=3D"4623">4.1 Fonctionnalit=C3=A9s cl=C3=A9=
s d=E2=80=99un navigateur :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4624" data-end=3D"4932">
<li data-start=3D"4624" data-end=3D"4670">
<p data-start=3D"4626" data-end=3D"4670">G=C3=A9rer la communication HTTP a=
vec le serveur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4671" data-end=3D"4713">
<p data-start=3D"4673" data-end=3D"4713">R=C3=A9soudre les noms de domaine =
via le DNS.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4714" data-end=3D"4769">
<p data-start=3D"4716" data-end=3D"4769">T=C3=A9l=C3=A9charger et ex=C3=A9c=
uter les fichiers (HTML, CSS, JS).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4770" data-end=3D"4848">
<p data-start=3D"4772" data-end=3D"4848">Afficher le r=C3=A9sultat =C3=A0 l=
=E2=80=99=C3=A9cran selon un <strong data-start=3D"4812" data-end=3D"4831">=
moteur de rendu</strong> (Blink, Gecko=E2=80=A6).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4849" data-end=3D"4882">
<p data-start=3D"4851" data-end=3D"4882">S=C3=A9curiser les =C3=A9changes (=
HTTPS).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4883" data-end=3D"4932">
<p data-start=3D"4885" data-end=3D"4932">G=C3=A9rer l=E2=80=99historique, l=
es cookies, le cache, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4934" data-end=3D"4937">
<h3 data-start=3D"4939" data-end=3D"4991">4.2 Cycle de vie d=E2=80=99une pa=
ge dans un navigateur :</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4993" data-end=3D"5383">
<li data-start=3D"4993" data-end=3D"5025">
<p data-start=3D"4996" data-end=3D"5025">L=E2=80=99utilisateur saisit une U=
