du <strong data-start=3D"5250" data-end=3D"5259">CSSOM</strong>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5262" data-end=3D"5319">
<p data-start=3D"5265" data-end=3D"5319">Il combine DOM + CSSOM pour former=
 le <strong data-start=3D"5303" data-end=3D"5318">render tree</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5320" data-end=3D"5362">
<p data-start=3D"5323" data-end=3D"5362">Il affiche la page (layout + paint=
ing).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5363" data-end=3D"5383">
<p data-start=3D"5366" data-end=3D"5383">Il ex=C3=A9cute le JS.</p>
</li>
</ol>
