 CSS ?</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"127" data-end=3D"149">(De d=C3=A9butant =C3=A0 expert)</p>
<hr data-start=3D"151" data-end=3D"154">
<h1 data-start=3D"156" data-end=3D"173">=F0=9F=A7=AD Introduction</h1>
<p data-start=3D"175" data-end=3D"432">Lorsque vous cr=C3=A9ez un site web =
en HTML, vous construisez une structure, un squelette. Mais cette structure=
 est <strong data-start=3D"286" data-end=3D"295">brute</strong> : textes no=
irs sur fond blanc, pas de mise en page sophistiqu=C3=A9e, pas de couleurs,=
 pas d=E2=80=99animations.<br data-start=3D"395" data-end=3D"398">
C=E2=80=99est l=C3=A0 qu=E2=80=99intervient le <strong data-start=3D"424" d=
ata-end=3D"431">CSS</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"434" data-end=3D"437">
<h1 data-start=3D"439" data-end=3D"464">=F0=9F=8C=88 1. D=C3=A9finition du =
CSS</h1>
<p data-start=3D"466" data-end=3D"559"><strong data-start=3D"466" data-end=
=3D"473">CSS</strong> signifie <strong data-start=3D"483" data-end=3D"509">=
Cascading Style Sheets</strong>, ou en fran=C3=A7ais <strong data-start=3D"=
526" data-end=3D"558">Feuilles de style en cascade</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"561" data-end=3D"838">Il s'agit d'un <strong data-start=3D=
"576" data-end=3D"596">langage de style</strong> qui permet de <strong data=
-start=3D"611" data-end=3D"634">d=C3=A9crire l'apparence</strong> et la <st=
rong data-start=3D"641" data-end=3D"657">pr=C3=A9sentation</strong> d'un do=
cument HTML.<br data-start=3D"677" data-end=3D"680">
Avec CSS, vous pouvez <strong data-start=3D"702" data-end=3D"714">styliser<=
/strong> vos pages web : couleurs, tailles, espacements, polices, alignemen=
t, bordures, arri=C3=A8re-plans, animations, transitions, etc.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"840" data-end=3D"843">
<h1 data-start=3D"845" data-end=3D"886">=F0=9F=A7=B1 2. S=C3=A9paration du =
fond et de la forme</h1>
<p data-start=3D"888" data-end=3D"937">HTML =3D <strong data-start=3D"895" =
data-end=3D"909">le contenu</strong><br data-start=3D"909" data-end=3D"912"=
>
CSS =3D <strong data-start=3D"918" data-end=3D"937">la pr=C3=A9sentation</s=
trong></p>
<p data-start=3D"939" data-end=3D"983">Cette s=C3=A9paration offre plusieur=
s avantages :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"985" data-end=3D"1282">
<li data-start=3D"985" data-end=3D"1056">
<p data-start=3D"987" data-end=3D"1056"><strong data-start=3D"987" data-end=
=3D"1001">Modularit=C3=A9</strong> : le m=C3=AAme CSS peut s=E2=80=99appliq=
uer =C3=A0 plusieurs pages HTML.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1057" data-end=3D"1130">
<p data-start=3D"1059" data-end=3D"1130"><strong data-start=3D"1059" data-e=
nd=3D"1077">Clart=C3=A9 du code</strong> : le HTML est plus lisible sans le=
s styles int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1131" data-end=3D"1212">
<p data-start=3D"1133" data-end=3D"1212"><strong data-start=3D"1133" data-e=
nd=3D"1158">Maintenance facilit=C3=A9e</strong> : on modifie l=E2=80=99appa=
rence sans toucher =C3=A0 la structure.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1213" data-end=3D"1282">
<p data-start=3D"1215" data-end=3D"1282"><strong data-start=3D"1215" data-e=
nd=3D"1232">Accessibilit=C3=A9</strong> : le contenu est compr=C3=A9hensibl=
e m=C3=AAme sans styles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<blockquote data-start=3D"1284" data-end=3D"1403">
<p data-start=3D"1286" data-end=3D"1403">=F0=9F=93=9D Ex. : un bouton <code=
