<hr data-start=3D"1913" data-end=3D"1916">
<h3 data-start=3D"1918" data-end=3D"1960">2.5 Particularit=C3=A9s et bonnes=
 pratiques</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1962" data-end=3D"2340">
<li data-start=3D"1962" data-end=3D"2087">
<p data-start=3D"1964" data-end=3D"2087">Le mot-cl=C3=A9 <code data-start=
=3D"1975" data-end=3D"1989">currentColor</code> : r=C3=A9f=C3=A9rence la va=
leur de la propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 <code data-start=3D"2028" data-end=3D"2035">=
color</code> h=C3=A9rit=C3=A9e, tr=C3=A8s utile pour les bordures, ic=C3=B4=
nes, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2088" data-end=3D"2246">
<p data-start=3D"2090" data-end=3D"2246">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 <code data-=
start=3D"2103" data-end=3D"2110">color</code> <strong data-start=3D"2111" d=
ata-end=3D"2121">h=C3=A9rite</strong> automatiquement aux =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment=
s enfants, ce qui signifie qu=E2=80=99ils prennent la m=C3=AAme couleur sau=
f si on la red=C3=A9finit explicitement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2247" data-end=3D"2340">
<p data-start=3D"2249" data-end=3D"2340">Toujours utiliser des couleurs ave=
c un <strong data-start=3D"2288" data-end=3D"2311">contraste suffisant</str=
ong> pour l=E2=80=99accessibilit=C3=A9 (WCAG).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2342" data-end=3D"2345">
<h2 data-start=3D"2347" data-end=3D"2384">3. La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 <code d=
ata-start=3D"2366" data-end=3D"2384">background-color</code></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2386" data-end=3D"2398">3.1 R=C3=B4le</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2400" data-end=3D"2486">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 <code data-=
start=3D"2413" data-end=3D"2431">background-color</code> d=C3=A9termine la =
couleur d=E2=80=99arri=C3=A8re-plan d=E2=80=99un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment HTML.</p=
>
