<hr data-start=3D"2905" data-end=3D"2908">
<h3 data-start=3D"2910" data-end=3D"2952">3.5 Particularit=C3=A9s et bonnes=
 pratiques</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2954" data-end=3D"3350">
<li data-start=3D"2954" data-end=3D"3082">
<p data-start=3D"2956" data-end=3D"3082">La couleur de fond ne s=E2=80=99h=
=C3=A9rite <strong data-start=3D"2987" data-end=3D"3010">pas automatiquemen=
t</strong>, contrairement =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"3028" data-end=3D"3035=
">color</code>. Elle s=E2=80=99applique uniquement =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99=C3=A9l=
=C3=A9ment cibl=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3083" data-end=3D"3231">
<p data-start=3D"3085" data-end=3D"3231">La valeur <code data-start=3D"3095=
" data-end=3D"3108">transparent</code> (valeur par d=C3=A9faut) signifie qu=
e l=E2=80=99=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment est <strong data-start=3D"3156" data-end=3D"3=
171">transparent</strong>, laissant voir la couleur ou l=E2=80=99image de f=
ond de son parent.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3232" data-end=3D"3350">
<p data-start=3D"3234" data-end=3D"3350">On peut combiner couleur de fond a=
vec une image d=E2=80=99arri=C3=A8re-plan (<code data-start=3D"3298" data-e=
nd=3D"3316">background-image</code>) pour cr=C3=A9er des effets complexes.<=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3352" data-end=3D"3355">
<h2 data-start=3D"3357" data-end=3D"3396">4. Les formats de couleurs d=C3=
=A9taill=C3=A9s</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3398" data-end=3D"3422">4.1 Noms de couleurs</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3424" data-end=3D"3588">
<li data-start=3D"3424" data-end=3D"3485">
<p data-start=3D"3426" data-end=3D"3485">140 noms standards (ex : <code dat=
a-start=3D"3451" data-end=3D"3456">red</code>, <code data-start=3D"3458" da=
ta-end=3D"3464">navy</code>, <code data-start=3D"3466" data-end=3D"3472">go=
ld</code>, <code data-start=3D"3474" data-end=3D"3484">darkcyan</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3486" data-end=3D"3523">
<p data-start=3D"3488" data-end=3D"3523">Facile =C3=A0 utiliser mais moins =
pr=C3=A9cis</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3524" data-end=3D"3588">
<p data-start=3D"3526" data-end=3D"3588">Peuvent poser probl=C3=A8me dans c=
ertains designs car peu flexibles</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3590" data-end=3D"3609">4.2 Hexad=C3=A9cimal</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3611" data-end=3D"3782">
<li data-start=3D"3611" data-end=3D"3652">
<p data-start=3D"3613" data-end=3D"3652">Syntaxe : <code data-start=3D"3623=
" data-end=3D"3632">#RRGGBB</code> ou raccourci <code data-start=3D"3646" d=
ata-end=3D"3652">#RGB</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3653" data-end=3D"3726">
<p data-start=3D"3655" data-end=3D"3726">Chaque paire repr=C3=A9sente la qu=
antit=C3=A9 de rouge, vert, bleu en hexad=C3=A9cimal</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3727" data-end=3D"3782">
<p data-start=3D"3729" data-end=3D"3782">Exemple : <code data-start=3D"3739=
" data-end=3D"3748">#FF0000</code> (rouge pur), <code data-start=3D"3762" d=
ata-end=3D"3771">#00FF00</code> (vert pur)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3784" data-end=3D"3802">4.3 RGB / RGBA</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3804" data-end=3D"3949">
<li data-start=3D"3804" data-end=3D"3848">
<p data-start=3D"3806" data-end=3D"3848"><code data-start=3D"3806" data-end=
=3D"3820">rgb(r, g, b)</code> avec r, g, b entre 0 et 255</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3849" data-end=3D"3912">
<p data-start=3D"3851" data-end=3D"3912"><code data-start=3D"3851" data-end=
=3D"3869">rgba(r, g, b, a)</code> avec a entre 0 (transparent) et 1 (opaque=
)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3913" data-end=3D"3949">
<p data-start=3D"3915" data-end=3D"3949">Permet la transparence dans <code =
data-start=3D"3943" data-end=3D"3949">rgba</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3951" data-end=3D"3969">4.4 HSL / HSLA</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3971" data-end=3D"4131">
<li data-start=3D"3971" data-end=3D"4008">
<p data-start=3D"3973" data-end=3D"4008"><code data-start=3D"3973" data-end=
=3D"4008">hsl(hue, saturation%, lightness%)</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4009" data-end=3D"4041">
<p data-start=3D"4011" data-end=3D"4041">Hue (teinte) en degr=C3=A9s (0-360=
)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4042" data-end=3D"4084">
<p data-start=3D"4044" data-end=3D"4084">Saturation et luminosit=C3=A9 en p=
ourcentages</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4085" data-end=3D"4131">
<p data-start=3D"4087" data-end=3D"4131"><code data-start=3D"4087" data-end=
=3D"4093">hsla</code> ajoute un canal alpha de transparence</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4133" data-end=3D"4136">
<h2 data-start=3D"4138" data-end=3D"4167">5. Transparence et opacit=C3=A9</=
h2>
<ul data-start=3D"4169" data-end=3D"4447">
<li data-start=3D"4169" data-end=3D"4235">
<p data-start=3D"4171" data-end=3D"4235"><code data-start=3D"4171" data-end=
=3D"4177">rgba</code> et <code data-start=3D"4181" data-end=3D"4187">hsla</=
code> permettent de g=C3=A9rer la transparence pr=C3=A9cis=C3=A9ment</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4236" data-end=3D"4322">
<p data-start=3D"4238" data-end=3D"4322"><code data-start=3D"4238" data-end=
=3D"4251">transparent</code> =3D couleur totalement transparente (utile pou=
r enlever couleur de fond)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4323" data-end=3D"4447">
<p data-start=3D"4325" data-end=3D"4447">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 CSS <code d=
ata-start=3D"4342" data-end=3D"4351">opacity</code> influence toute la bo=
=C3=AEte (texte, fond, bordures) contrairement =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"4=
417" data-end=3D"4435">background-color</code> transparent</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4449" data-end=3D"4452">
<h2 data-start=3D"4454" data-end=3D"4486">6. Contraste et accessibilit=C3=
=A9</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4488" data-end=3D"4519">6.1 Importance du contraste</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4521" data-end=3D"4628">Un contraste =C3=A9lev=C3=A9 entre=
 la couleur du texte (<code data-start=3D"4567" data-end=3D"4574">color</co=
de>) et le fond (<code data-start=3D"4588" data-end=3D"4606">background-col=
or</code>) est essentiel pour :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4630" data-end=3D"4744">
<li data-start=3D"4630" data-end=3D"4652">
<p data-start=3D"4632" data-end=3D"4652">Faciliter la lecture</p>
