<hr data-start=3D"5773" data-end=3D"5776">
<h2 data-start=3D"5778" data-end=3D"5814">7. Concepts avanc=C3=A9s li=C3=A9=
s au texte</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5816" data-end=3D"5832">7.1 H=C3=A9ritage</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5834" data-end=3D"6033">
<li data-start=3D"5834" data-end=3D"5939">
<p data-start=3D"5836" data-end=3D"5939"><code data-start=3D"5836" data-end=
=3D"5849">font-family</code>, <code data-start=3D"5851" data-end=3D"5862">f=
ont-size</code>, <code data-start=3D"5864" data-end=3D"5877">line-height</c=
ode>, <code data-start=3D"5879" data-end=3D"5886">color</code> sont <strong=
 data-start=3D"5892" data-end=3D"5903">h=C3=A9rit=C3=A9s</strong> par d=C3=
=A9faut dans la plupart des cas.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5940" data-end=3D"6033">
<p data-start=3D"5942" data-end=3D"6033"><code data-start=3D"5942" data-end=
=3D"5954">text-align</code> n=E2=80=99est pas forc=C3=A9ment h=C3=A9rit=C3=
=A9 automatiquement, donc =C3=A0 v=C3=A9rifier selon les besoins.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6035" data-end=3D"6103">7.2 Remplacer les polices avec <c=
ode data-start=3D"6070" data-end=3D"6082">@font-face</code> ou services ext=
ernes</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6105" data-end=3D"6206">
<li data-start=3D"6105" data-end=3D"6206">
<p data-start=3D"6107" data-end=3D"6206">Pour garantir l=E2=80=99uniformit=
=C3=A9, on peut importer des polices web avec <code data-start=3D"6173" dat=
a-end=3D"6185">@font-face</code> ou via Google Fonts.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6208" data-end=3D"6253">7.3 Effets typographiques compl=
=C3=A9mentaires</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6255" data-end=3D"6466">
<li data-start=3D"6255" data-end=3D"6282">
<p data-start=3D"6257" data-end=3D"6282"><code data-start=3D"6257" data-end=
=3D"6270">font-weight</code> (=C3=A9paisseur)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6283" data-end=3D"6308">
<p data-start=3D"6285" data-end=3D"6308"><code data-start=3D"6285" data-end=
=3D"6297">font-style</code> (italique)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6309" data-end=3D"6354">
<p data-start=3D"6311" data-end=3D"6354"><code data-start=3D"6311" data-end=
=3D"6327">letter-spacing</code> (espacement entre lettres)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6355" data-end=3D"6371">
<p data-start=3D"6357" data-end=3D"6371"><code data-start=3D"6357" data-end=
=3D"6371">word-spacing</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6372" data-end=3D"6425">
<p data-start=3D"6374" data-end=3D"6425"><code data-start=3D"6374" data-end=
=3D"6390">text-transform</code> (majuscule, minuscule, capitalise)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6426" data-end=3D"6463">
<p data-start=3D"6428" data-end=3D"6463"><code data-start=3D"6428" data-end=
=3D"6445">text-decoration</code> (soulign=C3=A9, barr=C3=A9)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6467" data-end=3D"6579">Ces propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s sont souv=
ent utilis=C3=A9es conjointement avec celles vues ici pour un contr=C3=B4le=
 typographique complet.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6581" data-end=3D"6584">
<h2 data-start=3D"6586" data-end=3D"6619">8. Accessibilit=C3=A9 et lisibili=
t=C3=A9</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6621" data-end=3D"6944">
<li data-start=3D"6621" data-end=3D"6700">
<p data-start=3D"6623" data-end=3D"6700">Toujours assurer un contraste suff=
isant entre la couleur du texte et le fond.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6701" data-end=3D"6773">
<p data-start=3D"6703" data-end=3D"6773">Favoriser des tailles de police <s=
trong data-start=3D"6735" data-end=3D"6750">adaptatives</strong> (ex : util=
iser <code data-start=3D"6766" data-end=3D"6771">rem</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6774" data-end=3D"6831">
<p data-start=3D"6776" data-end=3D"6831">Un bon <code data-start=3D"6783" d=
ata-end=3D"6796">line-height</code> am=C3=A9liore =C3=A9norm=C3=A9ment la l=
isibilit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6832" data-end=3D"6895">
<p data-start=3D"6834" data-end=3D"6895">Eviter des polices trop fantaisist=
es pour les contenus longs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6896" data-end=3D"6944">
<p data-start=3D"6898" data-end=3D"6944">Tester sur plusieurs appareils et =
r=C3=A9solutions.</p>
</li>
</ul>
