<h3 data-start=3D"2125" data-end=3D"2147">3.5 Notes avanc=C3=A9es</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2149" data-end=3D"2497">
<li data-start=3D"2149" data-end=3D"2257">
<p data-start=3D"2151" data-end=3D"2257">Si vous utilisez un pourcentage (e=
x: <code data-start=3D"2188" data-end=3D"2200">width: 50%</code>), la large=
ur sera 50% de la largeur de l=E2=80=99=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment parent.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2258" data-end=3D"2339">
<p data-start=3D"2260" data-end=3D"2339">Avec les unit=C3=A9s viewport (<co=
de data-start=3D"2286" data-end=3D"2290">vw</code>), <code data-start=3D"22=
93" data-end=3D"2300">100vw</code> correspond =C3=A0 la largeur de la fen=
=C3=AAtre.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2340" data-end=3D"2497">
<p data-start=3D"2342" data-end=3D"2497">Le mod=C3=A8le par d=C3=A9faut de =
la bo=C3=AEte (<code data-start=3D"2376" data-end=3D"2401">box-sizing: cont=
ent-box</code>) consid=C3=A8re que <code data-start=3D"2417" data-end=3D"24=
24">width</code> ne prend en compte que la zone de contenu, pas le padding =
ni la bordure.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2499" data-end=3D"2502">
<h2 data-start=3D"2504" data-end=3D"2528">4. Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 <code data=
-start=3D"2520" data-end=3D"2528">height</code></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2530" data-end=3D"2542">4.1 R=C3=B4le</h3>
