<p data-start=3D"3704" data-end=3D"3782">Le contenu aura un espace de 20px =
entre lui et la bordure, sur tous les c=C3=B4t=C3=A9s.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3784" data-end=3D"3802">5.5 Raccourcis</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3804" data-end=3D"4011">
<li data-start=3D"3804" data-end=3D"3863">
<p data-start=3D"3806" data-end=3D"3863"><code data-start=3D"3806" data-end=
=3D"3827">padding: 10px 20px;</code> =E2=86=92 10px haut/bas, 20px droite/g=
auche</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3864" data-end=3D"3934">
<p data-start=3D"3866" data-end=3D"3934"><code data-start=3D"3866" data-end=
=3D"3892">padding: 10px 15px 20px;</code> =E2=86=92 10px haut, 15px droite/=
gauche, 20px bas</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3935" data-end=3D"4011">
<p data-start=3D"3937" data-end=3D"4011"><code data-start=3D"3937" data-end=
=3D"3968">padding: 10px 15px 20px 25px;</code> =E2=86=92 respectivement hau=
t, droite, bas, gauche</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4013" data-end=3D"4048">5.6 Impact sur la taille totale</=
h3>
<p data-start=3D"4050" data-end=3D"4199">Par d=C3=A9faut, <code data-start=
=3D"4062" data-end=3D"4071">padding</code> augmente la taille totale de la =
