<h3 data-start=3D"2035" data-end=3D"2060">3.5 Points importants</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2062" data-end=3D"2213">
<li data-start=3D"2062" data-end=3D"2158">
<p data-start=3D"2064" data-end=3D"2158">Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments block perme=
ttent l=E2=80=99application de propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s dimensionnelles (<code =
data-start=3D"2139" data-end=3D"2146">width</code>, <code data-start=3D"214=
8" data-end=3D"2156">height</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2159" data-end=3D"2213">
<p data-start=3D"2161" data-end=3D"2213">Ils prennent toute la largeur disp=
onible par d=C3=A9faut.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2215" data-end=3D"2218">
<h2 data-start=3D"2220" data-end=3D"2244">4. La valeur <code data-start=3D"=
2236" data-end=3D"2244">inline</code></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2246" data-end=3D"2264">4.1 D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2266" data-end=3D"2383">Un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment avec <code da=
ta-start=3D"2282" data-end=3D"2299">display: inline</code> s=E2=80=99affich=
e <strong data-start=3D"2310" data-end=3D"2327">dans la ligne</strong> avec=
 d=E2=80=99autres =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments, sans cr=C3=A9er de rupture de ligne.<=
/p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2385" data-end=3D"2405">4.2 Comportement</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2407" data-end=3D"2676">
<li data-start=3D"2407" data-end=3D"2458">
<p data-start=3D"2409" data-end=3D"2458">L=E2=80=99=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment ne com=
mence pas sur une nouvelle ligne.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2459" data-end=3D"2556">
<p data-start=3D"2461" data-end=3D"2556">Sa largeur et hauteur ne peuvent p=
as =C3=AAtre d=C3=A9finies explicitement (elles s=E2=80=99adaptent au conte=
nu).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2557" data-end=3D"2611">
<p data-start=3D"2559" data-end=3D"2611">Les marges verticales (top et bott=
om) sont ignor=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2612" data-end=3D"2676">
<p data-start=3D"2614" data-end=3D"2676">Les marges horizontales (left et r=
ight) sont prises en compte.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"2678" data-end=3D"2723">4.3 Exemples d=E2=80=99=C3=A9l=C3=
=A9ments inline par d=C3=A9faut</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2725" data-end=3D"2815">
<li data-start=3D"2725" data-end=3D"2815">
<p data-start=3D"2727" data-end=3D"2815"><code data-start=3D"2727" data-end=
=3D"2735">&lt;span&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"2737" data-end=3D"2742">=
&lt;a&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"2744" data-end=3D"2754">&lt;strong&gt=
;</code>, <code data-start=3D"2756" data-end=3D"2762">&lt;em&gt;</code>, <c=
ode data-start=3D"2764" data-end=3D"2771">&lt;img&gt;</code> (techniquement=
 inline-block, voir plus bas)</p>
</li>
</ul>
