<h3 data-start=3D"2968" data-end=3D"2993">4.5 Points importants</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2995" data-end=3D"3266">
<li data-start=3D"2995" data-end=3D"3090">
<p data-start=3D"2997" data-end=3D"3090">Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments inline sont=
 id=C3=A9aux pour formater du texte ou des petits =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments dans u=
ne ligne.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3091" data-end=3D"3151">
<p data-start=3D"3093" data-end=3D"3151">Ils ne supportent pas la largeur e=
t la hauteur explicites.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3152" data-end=3D"3266">
<p data-start=3D"3154" data-end=3D"3266">L=E2=80=99espacement vertical est =
contr=C3=B4l=C3=A9 par la hauteur de ligne (<code data-start=3D"3214" data-=
end=3D"3227">line-height</code>) et la taille de police (<code data-start=
=3D"3253" data-end=3D"3264">font-size</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3268" data-end=3D"3271">
<h2 data-start=3D"3273" data-end=3D"3303">5. La valeur <code data-start=3D"=
3289" data-end=3D"3303">inline-block</code></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3305" data-end=3D"3323">5.1 D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3325" data-end=3D"3393"><code data-start=3D"3325" data-end=
=3D"3339">inline-block</code> combine les caract=C3=A9ristiques de <code da=
ta-start=3D"3372" data-end=3D"3380">inline</code> et <code data-start=3D"33=
84" data-end=3D"3391">block</code> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3395" data-end=3D"3569">
<li data-start=3D"3395" data-end=3D"3459">
<p data-start=3D"3397" data-end=3D"3459">L=E2=80=99=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment s=E2=
=80=99affiche <strong data-start=3D"3417" data-end=3D"3434">dans la ligne</=
strong> comme un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment inline.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3460" data-end=3D"3569">
<p data-start=3D"3462" data-end=3D"3569">Mais il se comporte <strong data-s=
tart=3D"3482" data-end=3D"3499">comme un bloc</strong> en ce qui concerne l=
a taille : on peut d=C3=A9finir sa largeur et hauteur.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3571" data-end=3D"3591">5.2 Comportement</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3593" data-end=3D"3780">
<li data-start=3D"3593" data-end=3D"3631">
<p data-start=3D"3595" data-end=3D"3631">Pas de rupture de ligne automatiqu=
e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3632" data-end=3D"3670">
<p data-start=3D"3634" data-end=3D"3670">Largeur et hauteur personnalisable=
s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3671" data-end=3D"3727">
<p data-start=3D"3673" data-end=3D"3727">Marges, paddings et bordures fonct=
ionnent normalement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3728" data-end=3D"3780">
<p data-start=3D"3730" data-end=3D"3780">Permet de cr=C3=A9er des =C3=A9l=
=C3=A9ments "bloc dans la ligne".</p>
</li>
</ul>
