<h3 data-start=3D"4123" data-end=3D"4148">5.4 Points importants</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4150" data-end=3D"4467">
<li data-start=3D"4150" data-end=3D"4260">
<p data-start=3D"4152" data-end=3D"4260">Tr=C3=A8s utile pour cr=C3=A9er de=
s boutons, des images ou des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments align=C3=A9s horizontalemen=
t avec dimensions fixes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4261" data-end=3D"4333">
<p data-start=3D"4263" data-end=3D"4333">Contrairement =C3=A0 <code data-st=
art=3D"4279" data-end=3D"4287">inline</code>, supporte la gestion compl=C3=
=A8te des dimensions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4334" data-end=3D"4467">
<p data-start=3D"4336" data-end=3D"4467">Attention aux espaces blancs dans =
le HTML qui peuvent cr=C3=A9er des espaces inattendus entre =C3=A9l=C3=A9me=
nts inline-block (un probl=C3=A8me connu).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4469" data-end=3D"4472">
<h2 data-start=3D"4474" data-end=3D"4496">6. La valeur <code data-start=3D"=
4490" data-end=3D"4496">none</code></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4498" data-end=3D"4516">6.1 D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4518" data-end=3D"4640"><code data-start=3D"4518" data-end=
=3D"4533">display: none</code> signifie <strong data-start=3D"4543" data-en=
d=3D"4570">ne pas afficher du tout</strong> l=E2=80=99=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment. Il=
 est compl=C3=A8tement retir=C3=A9 du rendu et du flux de la page.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4642" data-end=3D"4662">6.2 Comportement</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4664" data-end=3D"4838">
<li data-start=3D"4664" data-end=3D"4698">
<p data-start=3D"4666" data-end=3D"4698">L=E2=80=99=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment n=E2=
=80=99occupe aucun espace.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4699" data-end=3D"4747">
<p data-start=3D"4701" data-end=3D"4747">L=E2=80=99=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment et ses=
 enfants ne sont pas visibles.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4748" data-end=3D"4838">
<p data-start=3D"4750" data-end=3D"4838">Ne pas confondre avec <code data-s=
tart=3D"4772" data-end=3D"4792">visibility: hidden</code> qui cache l=E2=80=
=99=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment mais conserve son espace.</p>
</li>
</ul>
