<h2 data-start=3D"374" data-end=3D"407">1. Introduction =C3=A0 <code data-s=
tart=3D"395" data-end=3D"407">box-sizing</code></h2>
<p data-start=3D"409" data-end=3D"587">En CSS, chaque =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment est=
 repr=C3=A9sent=C3=A9 par une <strong data-start=3D"455" data-end=3D"464">b=
o=C3=AEte</strong> qui englobe plusieurs parties : le contenu, le padding (=
remplissage int=C3=A9rieur), la bordure (border), et la marge (margin).</p>
<p data-start=3D"589" data-end=3D"763">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 <strong data-=
start=3D"602" data-end=3D"618"><code data-start=3D"604" data-end=3D"616">bo=
