 les layouts adaptatifs.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5013" data-end=3D"5016">
<h2 data-start=3D"5018" data-end=3D"5035">9. Cas avanc=C3=A9s</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5037" data-end=3D"5068">9.1 Animation et transition</h3>
