<p data-start=3D"3086" data-end=3D"3133">La taille totale d=E2=80=99un =C3=
=A9l=C3=A9ment est la somme de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3135" data-end=3D"3332">
<li data-start=3D"3135" data-end=3D"3237">
<p data-start=3D"3137" data-end=3D"3237"><strong data-start=3D"3137" data-e=
nd=3D"3237">Width totale =3D width (contenu) + padding gauche + padding dro=
ite + border gauche + border droite</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3238" data-end=3D"3332">
<p data-start=3D"3240" data-end=3D"3332"><strong data-start=3D"3240" data-e=
nd=3D"3332">Height totale =3D height (contenu) + padding haut + padding bas=
 + border haut + border bas</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3334" data-end=3D"3421"><em data-start=3D"3334" data-end=
=3D"3345">Attention</em> : Ce calcul est valable pour <code data-start=3D"3=
375" data-end=3D"3400">box-sizing: content-box</code> (valeur par d=C3=A9fa=
ut).</p>
