<h2 data-start=3D"1629" data-end=3D"1671">3. Positionnement <code data-star=
t=3D"1650" data-end=3D"1658">static</code> (par d=C3=A9faut)</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1673" data-end=3D"1691">3.1 D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1693" data-end=3D"1935">
<li data-start=3D"1693" data-end=3D"1750">
<p data-start=3D"1695" data-end=3D"1750">C=E2=80=99est la valeur par d=C3=
=A9faut pour tous les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments HTML.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1751" data-end=3D"1838">
<p data-start=3D"1753" data-end=3D"1838">L=E2=80=99=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment est pl=
ac=C3=A9 dans le <strong data-start=3D"1781" data-end=3D"1796">flux normal<=
/strong> du document, sans d=C3=A9placement sp=C3=A9cifique.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1839" data-end=3D"1935">
<p data-start=3D"1841" data-end=3D"1935">Les propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s <code dat=
a-start=3D"1856" data-end=3D"1861">top</code>, <code data-start=3D"1863" da=
ta-end=3D"1871">bottom</code>, <code data-start=3D"1873" data-end=3D"1879">=
left</code>, <code data-start=3D"1881" data-end=3D"1888">right</code> <stro=
ng data-start=3D"1889" data-end=3D"1910">n=E2=80=99ont aucun effet</strong>=
 sur un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment <code data-start=3D"1926" data-end=3D"1934">stati=
c</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
