 l=E2=80=99espace selon l=E2=80=99ordre naturel dans le HTML.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2080" data-end=3D"2155">
<p data-start=3D"2082" data-end=3D"2155">Le comportement est simple, id=C3=
=A9al pour la plupart des contenus statiques.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2157" data-end=3D"2160">
<h2 data-start=3D"2162" data-end=3D"2193">4. Positionnement <code data-star=
t=3D"2183" data-end=3D"2193">relative</code></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2195" data-end=3D"2213">4.1 D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2215" data-end=3D"2556">
<li data-start=3D"2215" data-end=3D"2288">
<p data-start=3D"2217" data-end=3D"2288">L=E2=80=99=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment est d=
=E2=80=99abord positionn=C3=A9 selon le flux normal (comme <code data-start=
=3D"2278" data-end=3D"2286">static</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2289" data-end=3D"2416">
<p data-start=3D"2291" data-end=3D"2416">Ensuite, il peut =C3=AAtre <strong=
 data-start=3D"2313" data-end=3D"2323">d=C3=A9cal=C3=A9</strong> par rappor=
t =C3=A0 cette position initiale gr=C3=A2ce aux propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s <code =
data-start=3D"2383" data-end=3D"2388">top</code>, <code data-start=3D"2390"=
 data-end=3D"2398">bottom</code>, <code data-start=3D"2400" data-end=3D"240=
6">left</code>, <code data-start=3D"2408" data-end=3D"2415">right</code>.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2417" data-end=3D"2556">
<p data-start=3D"2419" data-end=3D"2556">L=E2=80=99espace occup=C3=A9 dans =
le flux ne change <strong data-start=3D"2458" data-end=3D"2465">pas</strong=
> : l=E2=80=99=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment conserve son emplacement initial, donc ne f=
ait pas bouger les autres =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments.</p>
</li>
</ul>
