<hr data-start=3D"3058" data-end=3D"3061">
<h2 data-start=3D"3063" data-end=3D"3094">5. Positionnement <code data-star=
t=3D"3084" data-end=3D"3094">absolute</code></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3096" data-end=3D"3114">5.1 D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3116" data-end=3D"3442">
<li data-start=3D"3116" data-end=3D"3204">
<p data-start=3D"3118" data-end=3D"3204">L=E2=80=99=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment est re=
tir=C3=A9 du flux normal, donc <strong data-start=3D"3160" data-end=3D"3186=
">ne prend plus d=E2=80=99espace</strong> dans le document.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3205" data-end=3D"3347">
<p data-start=3D"3207" data-end=3D"3347">Sa position est calcul=C3=A9e par =
rapport =C3=A0 son <strong data-start=3D"3250" data-end=3D"3314">anc=C3=AAt=
re le plus proche ayant une position autre que <code data-start=3D"3304" da=
ta-end=3D"3312">static</code></strong> (appel=C3=A9 <strong data-start=3D"3=
323" data-end=3D"3345">anc=C3=AAtre positionn=C3=A9</strong>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3348" data-end=3D"3442">
<p data-start=3D"3350" data-end=3D"3442">Si aucun anc=C3=AAtre positionn=C3=
=A9, la r=C3=A9f=C3=A9rence est la fen=C3=AAtre du navigateur (<code data-s=
tart=3D"3422" data-end=3D"3430">&lt;html&gt;</code> ou <code data-start=3D"=
3434" data-end=3D"3440">body</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
