<hr data-start=3D"6916" data-end=3D"6919">
<h2 data-start=3D"6921" data-end=3D"6960">9. Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s compl=C3=
=A9mentaires utiles</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6962" data-end=3D"7252">
<li data-start=3D"6962" data-end=3D"7070">
<p data-start=3D"6964" data-end=3D"7070"><code data-start=3D"6964" data-end=
=3D"6973">z-index</code> : contr=C3=B4le la superposition (pile) des =C3=A9=
l=C3=A9ments positionn=C3=A9s (relative, absolute, fixed, sticky).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7071" data-end=3D"7155">
<p data-start=3D"7073" data-end=3D"7155"><code data-start=3D"7073" data-end=
=3D"7078">top</code>, <code data-start=3D"7080" data-end=3D"7088">bottom</c=
ode>, <code data-start=3D"7090" data-end=3D"7096">left</code>, <code data-s=
tart=3D"7098" data-end=3D"7105">right</code> : d=C3=A9calages dans les posi=
tions autres que static.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7156" data-end=3D"7252">
<p data-start=3D"7158" data-end=3D"7252"><code data-start=3D"7158" data-end=
=3D"7169">transform</code> : peut aussi d=C3=A9placer un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment =
visuellement, mais ne change pas la position CSS.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7254" data-end=3D"7257">
<h2 data-start=3D"7259" data-end=3D"7298">10. Cas pratiques et pi=C3=A8ges =
courants</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"7300" data-end=3D"7335">10.1 Contexte de positionnement</=
h3>
<ul data-start=3D"7337" data-end=3D"7575">
<li data-start=3D"7337" data-end=3D"7502">
<p data-start=3D"7339" data-end=3D"7502">Si vous placez un =C3=A9l=C3=A9men=
t en <code data-start=3D"7368" data-end=3D"7378">absolute</code> sans anc=
=C3=AAtre positionn=C3=A9 (<code data-start=3D"7404" data-end=3D"7414">rela=
tive</code>, <code data-start=3D"7416" data-end=3D"7426">absolute</code>, <=
code data-start=3D"7428" data-end=3D"7435">fixed</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"7437" data-end=3D"7445">sticky</code>), il sera positionn=C3=A9 par rap=
port au document (viewport).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7503" data-end=3D"7575">
<p data-start=3D"7505" data-end=3D"7575">Pour limiter ce contexte, donnez <=
code data-start=3D"7538" data-end=3D"7558">position: relative</code> au par=
ent voulu.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"7577" data-end=3D"7613">10.2 Elements <code data-start=3D=
"7595" data-end=3D"7602">fixed</code> sur mobile</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"7615" data-end=3D"7762">
<li data-start=3D"7615" data-end=3D"7762">
<p data-start=3D"7617" data-end=3D"7762">Sur certains mobiles, les =C3=A9l=
=C3=A9ments <code data-start=3D"7652" data-end=3D"7659">fixed</code> peuven=
t avoir des comportements inattendus =C3=A0 cause des barres d=E2=80=99outi=
ls qui apparaissent/disparaissent.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"7764" data-end=3D"7793">10.3 <code data-start=3D"7773" da=
ta-end=3D"7781">sticky</code> et overflow</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"7795" data-end=3D"7977">
<li data-start=3D"7795" data-end=3D"7901">
<p data-start=3D"7797" data-end=3D"7901">Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments parents ave=
c <code data-start=3D"7823" data-end=3D"7841">overflow: hidden</code> ou <c=
ode data-start=3D"7845" data-end=3D"7861">overflow: auto</code> peuvent blo=
quer le comportement sticky.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7902" data-end=3D"7977">
<p data-start=3D"7904" data-end=3D"7977">Il faut =C3=A9viter ces propri=C3=
=A9t=C3=A9s sur les parents pour que sticky fonctionne.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7979" data-end=3D"7982">
<h2 data-start=3D"7984" data-end=3D"8010">11. Exercices pratiques</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"8012" data-end=3D"8384">
<li data-start=3D"8012" data-end=3D"8090">
<p data-start=3D"8014" data-end=3D"8090">Cr=C3=A9ez une bo=C3=AEte en <code=
 data-start=3D"8033" data-end=3D"8053">position: relative</code> et d=C3=A9=
placez-la avec <code data-start=3D"8074" data-end=3D"8079">top</code> et <c=
ode data-start=3D"8083" data-end=3D"8089">left</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8091" data-end=3D"8192">
<p data-start=3D"8093" data-end=3D"8192">Dans une bo=C3=AEte parent en <cod=
e data-start=3D"8118" data-end=3D"8128">relative</code>, placez un enfant e=
n <code data-start=3D"8150" data-end=3D"8160">absolute</code> et positionne=
z-le dans un coin.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8193" data-end=3D"8240">
<p data-start=3D"8195" data-end=3D"8240">Faites un menu en <code data-start=
=3D"8213" data-end=3D"8220">fixed</code> en haut de la page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8241" data-end=3D"8307">
<p data-start=3D"8243" data-end=3D"8307">Cr=C3=A9ez un header en <code data=
-start=3D"8262" data-end=3D"8270">sticky</code> qui reste visible en haut a=
u scroll.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8308" data-end=3D"8384">
<p data-start=3D"8310" data-end=3D"8384">Exp=C3=A9rimentez avec <code data-=
start=3D"8328" data-end=3D"8337">z-index</code> pour voir comment les =C3=
=A9l=C3=A9ments se superposent.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"8386" data-end=3D"8389">
<h2 data-start=3D"8391" data-end=3D"8408">12. Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"8410" data-end=3D"8634">Le positionnement en CSS est une b=
rique essentielle pour concevoir des mises en page modernes et dynamiques. =
La compr=C3=A9hension fine des diff=C3=A9rences entre <code data-start=3D"8=
563" data-end=3D"8571">static</code>, <code data-start=3D"8573" data-end=3D=
"8583">relative</code>, <code data-start=3D"8585" data-end=3D"8595">absolut=
e</code>, <code data-start=3D"8597" data-end=3D"8604">fixed</code>, et <cod=
e data-start=3D"8609" data-end=3D"8617">sticky</code> vous permettra :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8636" data-end=3D"8891">
<li data-start=3D"8636" data-end=3D"8702">
<p data-start=3D"8638" data-end=3D"8702">De contr=C3=B4ler pr=C3=A9cis=C3=
=A9ment o=C3=B9 et comment les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments s=E2=80=99affichent.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8703" data-end=3D"8800">
<p data-start=3D"8705" data-end=3D"8800">D=E2=80=99adapter vos designs aux =
diff=C3=A9rents usages (menus fixes, overlays, modaux, layouts complexes).<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8801" data-end=3D"8891">
<p data-start=3D"8803" data-end=3D"8891">D=E2=80=99=C3=A9viter les erreurs =
de mise en page souvent li=C3=A9es =C3=A0 un mauvais usage du positionnemen=
t.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"8893" data-end=3D"8896">
<p data-start=3D"8898" data-end=3D"8976">Si vous souhaitez, je peux aussi v=
ous fournir un tutoriel compl=C3=A9mentaire sur :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8978" data-end=3D"9144">
<li data-start=3D"8978" data-end=3D"9033">
<p data-start=3D"8980" data-end=3D"9033">L=E2=80=99usage avanc=C3=A9 de <co=
de data-start=3D"8998" data-end=3D"9007">z-index</code> et contexte d=E2=80=
=99empilement,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9034" data-end=3D"9086">
<p data-start=3D"9036" data-end=3D"9086">Les positionnements combin=C3=A9s =
avec Flexbox et Grid,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9087" data-end=3D"9144">
<p data-start=3D"9089" data-end=3D"9144">Les animations et transitions sur =
=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments positionn=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
