<p data-start=3D"2774" data-end=3D"2835">Ici, seul le premier <code data-st=
art=3D"2795" data-end=3D"2801">&lt;li&gt;</code> d=E2=80=99une liste sera e=
n gras et vert.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"2837" data-end=3D"2851">Variantes</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"2853" data-end=3D"2945">
<li data-start=3D"2853" data-end=3D"2892">
<p data-start=3D"2855" data-end=3D"2892"><code data-start=3D"2855" data-end=
=3D"2868">:last-child</code> pour le dernier enfant.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2893" data-end=3D"2945">
<p data-start=3D"2895" data-end=3D"2945"><code data-start=3D"2895" data-end=
=3D"2910">:nth-child(n)</code> pour s=C3=A9lectionner le ni=C3=A8me enfant.=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2947" data-end=3D"2950">
<h3 data-start=3D"2952" data-end=3D"3022">3.4 <code data-start=3D"2960" dat=
a-end=3D"2975">:nth-child(n)</code> =E2=80=94 S=C3=A9lectionner des enfants=
 selon leur position</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3024" data-end=3D"3114">
<li data-start=3D"3024" data-end=3D"3058">
<p data-start=3D"3026" data-end=3D"3058">Plus flexible que <code data-start=
=3D"3044" data-end=3D"3057">first-child</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3059" data-end=3D"3114">
<p data-start=3D"3061" data-end=3D"3114"><code data-start=3D"3061" data-end=
=3D"3064">n</code> peut =C3=AAtre un chiffre, un mot cl=C3=A9, ou une formu=
le.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"3116" data-end=3D"3129">Exemples</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"3131" data-end=3D"3299">
<li data-start=3D"3131" data-end=3D"3168">
<p data-start=3D"3133" data-end=3D"3168"><code data-start=3D"3133" data-end=
=3D"3150">li:nth-child(2)</code> : le 2=C3=A8me enfant.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3169" data-end=3D"3209">
<p data-start=3D"3171" data-end=3D"3209"><code data-start=3D"3171" data-end=
=3D"3190">li:nth-child(odd)</code> : enfants impairs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3210" data-end=3D"3249">
<p data-start=3D"3212" data-end=3D"3249"><code data-start=3D"3212" data-end=
=3D"3232">li:nth-child(even)</code> : enfants pairs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3250" data-end=3D"3299">
<p data-start=3D"3252" data-end=3D"3299"><code data-start=3D"3252" data-end=
=3D"3272">li:nth-child(3n+1)</code> : enfants 1, 4, 7, 10, ...</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3301" data-end=3D"3304">
<h3 data-start=3D"3306" data-end=3D"3360">3.5 <code data-start=3D"3314" dat=
a-end=3D"3327">:last-child</code> =E2=80=94 S=C3=A9lectionner le dernier en=
fant</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3362" data-end=3D"3425">Similaire =C3=A0 <code data-start=
=3D"3374" data-end=3D"3388">:first-child</code>, mais pour le dernier =C3=
=A9l=C3=A9ment fr=C3=A8re.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3427" data-end=3D"3430">
<h3 data-start=3D"3432" data-end=3D"3514">3.6 <code data-start=3D"3440" dat=
a-end=3D"3448">:not()</code> =E2=80=94 S=C3=A9lectionner les =C3=A9l=C3=A9m=
ents qui ne correspondent pas au s=C3=A9lecteur</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3516" data-end=3D"3568">
<li data-start=3D"3516" data-end=3D"3568">
<p data-start=3D"3518" data-end=3D"3568">Permet d=E2=80=99exclure certains =
=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments dans un groupe.</p>
</li>
</ul>
