<ul data-start=3D"3775" data-end=3D"3924">
<li data-start=3D"3775" data-end=3D"3828">
<p data-start=3D"3777" data-end=3D"3828"><code data-start=3D"3777" data-end=
=3D"3788">:disabled</code> cible les champs ou boutons d=C3=A9sactiv=C3=A9s=
