<hr data-start=3D"4044" data-end=3D"4047">
<h2 data-start=3D"4049" data-end=3D"4092">4. Pseudo-classes d=E2=80=99inter=
action avanc=C3=A9es</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"4094" data-end=3D"4345">
<li data-start=3D"4094" data-end=3D"4140">
<p data-start=3D"4096" data-end=3D"4140"><code data-start=3D"4096" data-end=
=3D"4105">:active</code> =E2=80=94 =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment activ=C3=A9 (cliqu=C3=
=A9, press=C3=A9).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4141" data-end=3D"4202">
<p data-start=3D"4143" data-end=3D"4202"><code data-start=3D"4143" data-end=
=3D"4158">:focus-within</code> =E2=80=94 un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment qui contient =
un enfant focus=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4203" data-end=3D"4295">
<p data-start=3D"4205" data-end=3D"4295"><code data-start=3D"4205" data-end=
=3D"4215">:visited</code> =E2=80=94 liens d=C3=A9j=C3=A0 visit=C3=A9s (avec=
 des restrictions de styles pour la confidentialit=C3=A9).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4296" data-end=3D"4345">
<p data-start=3D"4298" data-end=3D"4345"><code data-start=3D"4298" data-end=
=3D"4307">:target</code> =E2=80=94 cible un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment via l=E2=80=
=99URL (ancre).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4347" data-end=3D"4350">
<h2 data-start=3D"4352" data-end=3D"4395">5. Pseudo-classes structurelles a=
vanc=C3=A9es</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"4397" data-end=3D"4623">
<li data-start=3D"4397" data-end=3D"4450">
<p data-start=3D"4399" data-end=3D"4450"><code data-start=3D"4399" data-end=
=3D"4407">:empty</code> =E2=80=94 =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment sans enfants (texte ou =
balises).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4451" data-end=3D"4503">
