<li data-start=3D"4223" data-end=3D"4283">
<p data-start=3D"4225" data-end=3D"4283"><code data-start=3D"4225" data-end=
=3D"4241">::first-letter</code> =E2=80=94 applique un style =C3=A0 la premi=
