<hr data-start=3D"4599" data-end=3D"4602">
<h2 data-start=3D"4604" data-end=3D"4627">11. Bonnes pratiques</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"4629" data-end=3D"4980">
<li data-start=3D"4629" data-end=3D"4721">
<p data-start=3D"4631" data-end=3D"4721">Ne pas surcharger le style d=E2=80=
=99un pseudo-=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment : il ne remplace pas une vraie balise HTML.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4722" data-end=3D"4819">
<p data-start=3D"4724" data-end=3D"4819">Toujours inclure <code data-start=
=3D"4741" data-end=3D"4750">content</code>, m=C3=AAme si vide (<code data-s=
tart=3D"4766" data-end=3D"4779">content: ""</code>) pour des =C3=A9l=C3=A9m=
ents purement d=C3=A9coratifs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4820" data-end=3D"4898">
<p data-start=3D"4822" data-end=3D"4898">Utilisez <code data-start=3D"4831"=
 data-end=3D"4851">position: absolute</code> ou <code data-start=3D"4855" d=
ata-end=3D"4865">relative</code> pour des effets visuels avanc=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4899" data-end=3D"4980">
<p data-start=3D"4901" data-end=3D"4980">Combinez avec <code data-start=3D"=
4915" data-end=3D"4927">transition</code> et <code data-start=3D"4931" data=
-end=3D"4942">animation</code> pour cr=C3=A9er des interactions subtiles.</=
p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4982" data-end=3D"4985">
<h2 data-start=3D"4987" data-end=3D"5005">12. Limitations</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5007" data-end=3D"5309">
<li data-start=3D"5007" data-end=3D"5104">
<p data-start=3D"5009" data-end=3D"5104">Ne fonctionne pas sur les balises =
<code data-start=3D"5043" data-end=3D"5050">input</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"5052" data-end=3D"5057">img</code>, <code data-start=3D"5059" data-end=
=3D"5063">br</code>, etc. (=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments dits <strong data-start=3D"50=
85" data-end=3D"5102">auto-fermants</strong>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5105" data-end=3D"5217">
<p data-start=3D"5107" data-end=3D"5217">Les pseudo-=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments ne p=
euvent pas =C3=AAtre cibl=C3=A9s directement en JavaScript ou DOM (sauf via=
 <code data-start=3D"5197" data-end=3D"5215">getComputedStyle</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5218" data-end=3D"5309">
<p data-start=3D"5220" data-end=3D"5309">Pour les effets dynamiques ou inte=
ractifs complexes, privil=C3=A9gier les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments HTML r=C3=A9els.=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5311" data-end=3D"5314">
<h2 data-start=3D"5316" data-end=3D"5347">13. Compatibilit=C3=A9 navigateur=
</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5349" data-end=3D"5459"><code data-start=3D"5349" data-end=
=3D"5359">::before</code> et <code data-start=3D"5363" data-end=3D"5372">::=
after</code> sont <strong data-start=3D"5378" data-end=3D"5401">largement s=
upport=C3=A9s</strong> dans tous les navigateurs modernes depuis tr=C3=A8s =
longtemps.</p>
<p data-start=3D"5461" data-end=3D"5689">Il existe une ancienne syntaxe ave=
c un seul deux-points (<code data-start=3D"5518" data-end=3D"5527">:before<=
/code>, <code data-start=3D"5529" data-end=3D"5537">:after</code>), toujour=
s reconnue, mais on recommande aujourd=E2=80=99hui d=E2=80=99utiliser la fo=
rme <strong data-start=3D"5610" data-end=3D"5630">avec deux-points</strong>=
 (<code data-start=3D"5632" data-end=3D"5642">::before</code>, <code data-s=
tart=3D"5644" data-end=3D"5653">::after</code>) pour suivre la sp=C3=A9cifi=
cation CSS3.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5691" data-end=3D"5694">
<h2 data-start=3D"5696" data-end=3D"5713">14. Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5715" data-end=3D"5869">Les pseudo-=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments <cod=
e data-start=3D"5735" data-end=3D"5745">::before</code> et <code data-start=
=3D"5749" data-end=3D"5758">::after</code> sont de puissants alli=C3=A9s po=
ur enrichir vos interfaces <strong data-start=3D"5813" data-end=3D"5837">sa=
ns toucher au HTML</strong>. Ils sont indispensables pour :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5871" data-end=3D"6023">
<li data-start=3D"5871" data-end=3D"5907">
<p data-start=3D"5873" data-end=3D"5907">Ajouter des d=C3=A9corations =C3=
=A9l=C3=A9gantes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5908" data-end=3D"5953">
<p data-start=3D"5910" data-end=3D"5953">Am=C3=A9liorer la lisibilit=C3=A9 =
et l=E2=80=99accessibilit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5954" data-end=3D"6023">
<p data-start=3D"5956" data-end=3D"6023">Maintenir une s=C3=A9paration stri=
cte entre structure HTML et style CSS.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6025" data-end=3D"6101">Leur ma=C3=AEtrise permet de cr=C3=
=A9er des designs modernes, sobres, et maintenables.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6103" data-end=3D"6106">
<p data-start=3D"6108" data-end=3D"6338" data-is-last-node=3D"" data-is-onl=
y-node=3D"">Souhaitez-vous que je vous montre comment combiner <code data-s=
tart=3D"6159" data-end=3D"6169">::before</code> et <code data-start=3D"6173=
" data-end=3D"6181">:hover</code> pour cr=C3=A9er des effets interactifs co=
mme des animations de survol ? Ou bien un cas pratique complet (comme un bo=
uton stylis=C3=A9, un tooltip, une alerte, etc.) ?</p></div></div></div></d=
iv><div class=3D"flex absolute start-0 end-0 flex justify-start"><div class=
