<li data-start=3D"497" data-end=3D"566">
<p data-start=3D"499" data-end=3D"566">la <strong data-start=3D"502" data-e=
nd=3D"520">r=C3=A9organisation</strong> des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments sans modifie=
r le HTML (<code data-start=3D"557" data-end=3D"564">order</code>),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"567" data-end=3D"673">
<p data-start=3D"569" data-end=3D"673">la <strong data-start=3D"572" data-e=
nd=3D"599">gestion de l=E2=80=99espacement</strong> entre les =C3=A9l=C3=A9=
ments (<code data-start=3D"620" data-end=3D"625">gap</code>, <code data-sta=
rt=3D"627" data-end=3D"635">margin</code>, <code data-start=3D"637" data-en=
