>align-content</code>),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"674" data-end=3D"762">
<p data-start=3D"676" data-end=3D"762">le <strong data-start=3D"679" data-e=
nd=3D"710">dimensionnement intelligent</strong> (<code data-start=3D"712" d=
ata-end=3D"723">flex-grow</code>, <code data-start=3D"725" data-end=3D"738"=
>flex-shrink</code>, <code data-start=3D"740" data-end=3D"752">flex-basis</=
code>, <code data-start=3D"754" data-end=3D"760">flex</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
