<hr data-start=3D"6181" data-end=3D"6184">
<h2 data-start=3D"6186" data-end=3D"6216">=F0=9F=A7=A0 Astuces professionne=
lles</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6218" data-end=3D"6609">
<li data-start=3D"6218" data-end=3D"6322">
<p data-start=3D"6220" data-end=3D"6322">Pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9rez les polices sys=
t=C3=A8me (<code data-start=3D"6250" data-end=3D"6265">-apple-system</code>=
, <code data-start=3D"6267" data-end=3D"6277">Segoe UI</code>, <code data-s=
tart=3D"6279" data-end=3D"6287">Roboto</code>, etc.) pour la coh=C3=A9rence=
 visuelle.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6323" data-end=3D"6415">
<p data-start=3D"6325" data-end=3D"6415">N=E2=80=99utilisez pas <code data-=
start=3D"6340" data-end=3D"6355">outline: none</code> sans alternative : ga=
rdez un retour visuel d=E2=80=99accessibilit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6416" data-end=3D"6476">
<p data-start=3D"6418" data-end=3D"6476">Int=C3=A9grez une animation douce =
sur les transitions de focus.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6477" data-end=3D"6609">
<p data-start=3D"6479" data-end=3D"6609">Si vous utilisez des composants pe=
rsonnalis=C3=A9s (<code data-start=3D"6526" data-end=3D"6533">radio</code>,=
 <code data-start=3D"6535" data-end=3D"6545">checkbox</code>), <strong data=
-start=3D"6548" data-end=3D"6582">testez l'accessibilit=C3=A9 clavier</stro=
ng> (<code data-start=3D"6584" data-end=3D"6589">tab</code>, <code data-sta=
rt=3D"6591" data-end=3D"6598">enter</code>, <code data-start=3D"6600" data-=
end=3D"6607">space</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6611" data-end=3D"6614">
<h2 data-start=3D"6616" data-end=3D"6632">=F0=9F=8F=81 Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6634" data-end=3D"6731">Le <strong data-start=3D"6637" dat=
a-end=3D"6667">style d=E2=80=99un formulaire HTML</strong> ne doit pas =C3=
=AAtre n=C3=A9glig=C3=A9. Une interface agr=C3=A9able et coh=C3=A9rente :</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"6732" data-end=3D"6844">
<li data-start=3D"6732" data-end=3D"6763">
<p data-start=3D"6734" data-end=3D"6763"><strong data-start=3D"6734" data-e=
nd=3D"6762">augmente les conversions</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6764" data-end=3D"6809">
<p data-start=3D"6766" data-end=3D"6809"><strong data-start=3D"6766" data-e=
nd=3D"6808">renforce la confiance des utilisateurs</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6810" data-end=3D"6844">
<p data-start=3D"6812" data-end=3D"6844">et <strong data-start=3D"6815" dat=
a-end=3D"6843">am=C3=A9liore l=E2=80=99accessibilit=C3=A9</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6846" data-end=3D"6986">Gr=C3=A2ce au CSS moderne, on peut=
 styliser <strong data-start=3D"6885" data-end=3D"6923">presque tous les co=
mposants natifs</strong>, avec des r=C3=A9sultats dignes des biblioth=C3=A8=
ques UI sophistiqu=C3=A9es.</p>
