nd=3D"1505">Bonnes pratiques :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1507" data-end=3D"1672">
<li data-start=3D"1507" data-end=3D"1546">
<p data-start=3D"1509" data-end=3D"1546">Utiliser <strong data-start=3D"151=
8" data-end=3D"1545">un seul <code data-start=3D"1528" data-end=3D"1534">&l=
t;h1&gt;</code> par page</strong>.</p>
