</li>
<li data-start=3D"681" data-end=3D"774">
<p data-start=3D"683" data-end=3D"774">La <strong data-start=3D"686" data-e=
nd=3D"700">navigation</strong> (notamment via les technologies d=E2=80=99as=
sistance comme les lecteurs d=E2=80=99=C3=A9cran),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"775" data-end=3D"823">
<p data-start=3D"777" data-end=3D"823">L=E2=80=99<strong data-start=3D"779"=
 data-end=3D"793">indexation</strong> par les moteurs de recherche,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"824" data-end=3D"864">
<p data-start=3D"826" data-end=3D"864">La maintenance et l=E2=80=99=C3=A9vo=
lution du site.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"866" data-end=3D"980">Le HTML s=C3=A9mantique offre des ba=
lises sp=C3=A9cifiques qui portent un <strong data-start=3D"930" data-end=
=3D"938">sens</strong> et permettent cette structuration claire.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"982" data-end=3D"985">
<h2 data-start=3D"987" data-end=3D"1035">2. Principes de base de la hi=C3=
=A9rarchie en HTML</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1037" data-end=3D"1074">2.1. Les titres : <code data-star=
t=3D"1059" data-end=3D"1065">&lt;h1&gt;</code> =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"1=
068" data-end=3D"1074">&lt;h6&gt;</code></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1076" data-end=3D"1270">
<li data-start=3D"1076" data-end=3D"1141">
<p data-start=3D"1078" data-end=3D"1141">Les balises de titres d=C3=A9finis=
sent la <strong data-start=3D"1115" data-end=3D"1140">hi=C3=A9rarchie du co=
ntenu</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1142" data-end=3D"1222">
<p data-start=3D"1144" data-end=3D"1222"><code data-start=3D"1144" data-end=
=3D"1150">&lt;h1&gt;</code> est le titre principal, puis viennent <code dat=
a-start=3D"1189" data-end=3D"1195">&lt;h2&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"1=
197" data-end=3D"1203">&lt;h3&gt;</code>, =E2=80=A6 jusqu=E2=80=99=C3=A0 <c=
ode data-start=3D"1215" data-end=3D"1221">&lt;h6&gt;</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1223" data-end=3D"1270">
<p data-start=3D"1225" data-end=3D"1270">Chaque niveau est un sous-titre du=
 pr=C3=A9c=C3=A9dent.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1272" data-end=3D"1296"><strong data-start=3D"1272" data-e=
nd=3D"1296">R=C3=A8gles importantes :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1298" data-end=3D"1522">
<li data-start=3D"1298" data-end=3D"1354">
<p data-start=3D"1300" data-end=3D"1354">Utiliser un seul <code data-start=
=3D"1317" data-end=3D"1323">&lt;h1&gt;</code> par page (le sujet principal)=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1355" data-end=3D"1429">
<p data-start=3D"1357" data-end=3D"1429">Respecter l=E2=80=99ordre logique =
: un <code data-start=3D"1388" data-end=3D"1394">&lt;h3&gt;</code> doit =C3=
=AAtre dans une section <code data-start=3D"1422" data-end=3D"1428">&lt;h2&=
gt;</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1430" data-end=3D"1522">
<p data-start=3D"1432" data-end=3D"1522">Ne pas sauter de niveaux (=C3=A9vi=
ter un <code data-start=3D"1468" data-end=3D"1474">&lt;h4&gt;</code> direct=
ement apr=C3=A8s un <code data-start=3D"1496" data-end=3D"1502">&lt;h2&gt;<=
/code> sans <code data-start=3D"1508" data-end=3D"1514">&lt;h3&gt;</code> e=
ntre).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1524" data-end=3D"1537"><strong data-start=3D"1524" data-e=
nd=3D"1537">Exemple :</strong></p>
