<hr data-start=3D"1686" data-end=3D"1689">
<h3 data-start=3D"1691" data-end=3D"1734">2.2. Sections et regroupements lo=
giques</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1736" data-end=3D"1839">Pour bien structurer, on utilise d=
es conteneurs s=C3=A9mantiques pour diviser la page en parties coh=C3=A9ren=
tes.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1841" data-end=3D"2237">
<li data-start=3D"1841" data-end=3D"1915">
<p data-start=3D"1843" data-end=3D"1915"><code data-start=3D"1843" data-end=
=3D"1854">&lt;section&gt;</code> : une section th=C3=A9matique du document,=
 souvent avec un titre.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1916" data-end=3D"1978">
<p data-start=3D"1918" data-end=3D"1978"><code data-start=3D"1918" data-end=
=3D"1929">&lt;article&gt;</code> : contenu autonome (ex : article de blog, =
news).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1979" data-end=3D"2039">
<p data-start=3D"1981" data-end=3D"2039"><code data-start=3D"1981" data-end=
=3D"1988">&lt;nav&gt;</code> : section de navigation (menus, liens importan=
ts).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2040" data-end=3D"2109">
<p data-start=3D"2042" data-end=3D"2109"><code data-start=3D"2042" data-end=
=3D"2051">&lt;aside&gt;</code> : contenu annexes ou compl=C3=A9mentaire (si=
debar, citations).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2110" data-end=3D"2180">
<p data-start=3D"2112" data-end=3D"2180"><code data-start=3D"2112" data-end=
=3D"2122">&lt;header&gt;</code> : en-t=C3=AAte d=E2=80=99une page ou d=E2=
=80=99une section (titre, logo, nav).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2181" data-end=3D"2237">
<p data-start=3D"2183" data-end=3D"2237"><code data-start=3D"2183" data-end=
=3D"2193">&lt;footer&gt;</code> : pied de page d=E2=80=99une page ou d=E2=
=80=99une section.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2239" data-end=3D"2342">Ces balises apportent un <strong d=
ata-start=3D"2264" data-end=3D"2272">sens</strong> =C3=A0 la structure, lis=
ible par tous (humains, robots, lecteurs d=E2=80=99=C3=A9cran).</p>
