<h3 data-start=3D"2982" data-end=3D"3041">3.2. Le r=C3=B4le de chaque balis=
e dans la structure logique</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3043" data-end=3D"3465">
<li data-start=3D"3043" data-end=3D"3119">
<p data-start=3D"3045" data-end=3D"3119"><code data-start=3D"3045" data-end=
