<hr data-start=3D"4755" data-end=3D"4758">
<h2 data-start=3D"4760" data-end=3D"4830">6. Importance pour le r=C3=A9f=C3=
=A9rencement (SEO) et l=E2=80=99accessibilit=C3=A9 (a11y)</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"4832" data-end=3D"5102">
<li data-start=3D"4832" data-end=3D"4907">
<p data-start=3D"4834" data-end=3D"4907">Le HTML s=C3=A9mantique aide les m=
oteurs =C3=A0 mieux indexer et classer vos pages.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4908" data-end=3D"5017">
<p data-start=3D"4910" data-end=3D"5017">Les technologies d=E2=80=99assista=
nce exploitent cette structure pour aider les personnes en situation de han=
dicap.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5018" data-end=3D"5102">
<p data-start=3D"5020" data-end=3D"5102">Une bonne structure augmente le te=
mps pass=C3=A9 sur le site, r=C3=A9duit le taux de rebond.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5104" data-end=3D"5107">
<h2 data-start=3D"5109" data-end=3D"5156">7. Outils pour v=C3=A9rifier la s=
tructure logique</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5158" data-end=3D"5464">
<li data-start=3D"5158" data-end=3D"5241">
<p data-start=3D"5160" data-end=3D"5241"><strong data-start=3D"5160" data-e=
nd=3D"5189">Navigateurs avec DevTools</strong> (ex: Chrome, Firefox) : insp=
ecter la structure DOM.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5242" data-end=3D"5333">
<p data-start=3D"5244" data-end=3D"5333"><strong data-start=3D"5244" data-e=
nd=3D"5272">Extensions/accessibilit=C3=A9</strong> : axe-core, WAVE pour te=
ster la s=C3=A9mantique et accessibilit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5334" data-end=3D"5387">
<p data-start=3D"5336" data-end=3D"5387"><strong data-start=3D"5336" data-e=
nd=3D"5357">Google Lighthouse</strong> : audit SEO et accessibilit=C3=A9.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5388" data-end=3D"5464">
<p data-start=3D"5390" data-end=3D"5464"><strong data-start=3D"5390" data-e=
nd=3D"5409">Validators HTML</strong> : <a data-start=3D"5412" data-end=3D"5=
436" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=3D"" href=3D"https://validator.=
w3.org/">https://validator.w3.org</a> pour d=C3=A9tecter erreurs HTML.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5466" data-end=3D"5469">
<h2 data-start=3D"5471" data-end=3D"5504">8. R=C3=A9sum=C3=A9 des bonnes pr=
atiques</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5506" data-end=3D"6051">
<li data-start=3D"5506" data-end=3D"5545">
<p data-start=3D"5508" data-end=3D"5545">Utiliser <strong data-start=3D"551=
7" data-end=3D"5535">un seul <code data-start=3D"5527" data-end=3D"5533">&l=
t;h1&gt;</code></strong> par page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5546" data-end=3D"5618">
<p data-start=3D"5548" data-end=3D"5618">Structurer les titres dans l=E2=80=
=99ordre logique : <code data-start=3D"5593" data-end=3D"5599">&lt;h1&gt;</=
code>, <code data-start=3D"5601" data-end=3D"5607">&lt;h2&gt;</code>, <code=
 data-start=3D"5609" data-end=3D"5615">&lt;h3&gt;</code>...</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5619" data-end=3D"5765">
<p data-start=3D"5621" data-end=3D"5765">Utiliser les balises s=C3=A9mantiq=
ues pour <strong data-start=3D"5659" data-end=3D"5683">organiser le contenu=
</strong> : <code data-start=3D"5686" data-end=3D"5696">&lt;header&gt;</cod=
e>, <code data-start=3D"5698" data-end=3D"5705">&lt;nav&gt;</code>, <code d=
ata-start=3D"5707" data-end=3D"5715">&lt;main&gt;</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"5717" data-end=3D"5728">&lt;article&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"573=
0" data-end=3D"5741">&lt;section&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"5743" data=
-end=3D"5752">&lt;aside&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"5754" data-end=3D"5=
764">&lt;footer&gt;</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5766" data-end=3D"5817">
<p data-start=3D"5768" data-end=3D"5817">Chaque section doit avoir un <stro=
ng data-start=3D"5797" data-end=3D"5816">titre explicite</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5818" data-end=3D"5905">
<p data-start=3D"5820" data-end=3D"5905">=C3=89viter les balises g=C3=A9n=
=C3=A9riques <code data-start=3D"5850" data-end=3D"5857">&lt;div&gt;</code>=
 ou <code data-start=3D"5861" data-end=3D"5869">&lt;span&gt;</code> quand u=
ne balise s=C3=A9mantique existe.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5906" data-end=3D"5970">
<p data-start=3D"5908" data-end=3D"5970">Toujours garder la structure logiq=
ue et coh=C3=A9rente du document.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5971" data-end=3D"6051">
<p data-start=3D"5973" data-end=3D"6051">V=C3=A9rifier r=C3=A9guli=C3=A8rem=
ent avec des outils pour garantir qualit=C3=A9 et accessibilit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6053" data-end=3D"6056">
<h2 data-start=3D"6058" data-end=3D"6081">9. Exercice pratique</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6083" data-end=3D"6115">Construisez une page HTML avec :</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"6117" data-end=3D"6393">
<li data-start=3D"6117" data-end=3D"6164">
<p data-start=3D"6119" data-end=3D"6164">Une ent=C3=AAte avec titre <code d=
ata-start=3D"6141" data-end=3D"6147">&lt;h1&gt;</code> et menu <code data-s=
tart=3D"6156" data-end=3D"6163">&lt;nav&gt;</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6165" data-end=3D"6237">
<p data-start=3D"6167" data-end=3D"6237">Une zone principale <code data-sta=
rt=3D"6187" data-end=3D"6195">&lt;main&gt;</code> contenant plusieurs artic=
les <code data-start=3D"6225" data-end=3D"6236">&lt;article&gt;</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6238" data-end=3D"6303">
<p data-start=3D"6240" data-end=3D"6303">Chaque article structur=C3=A9 en s=
ections avec titres hi=C3=A9rarchiques.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6304" data-end=3D"6363">
<p data-start=3D"6306" data-end=3D"6363">Une barre lat=C3=A9rale <code data=
-start=3D"6325" data-end=3D"6334">&lt;aside&gt;</code> avec contenu compl=
=C3=A9mentaire.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6364" data-end=3D"6393">
<p data-start=3D"6366" data-end=3D"6393">Un pied de page <code data-start=
=3D"6382" data-end=3D"6392">&lt;footer&gt;</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6395" data-end=3D"6477">V=C3=A9rifiez la hi=C3=A9rarchie d=
es titres et la bonne utilisation des balises s=C3=A9mantiques.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6479" data-end=3D"6482">
<h2 data-start=3D"6484" data-end=3D"6501">10. Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6503" data-end=3D"6848">La structuration logique et hi=C3=
=A9rarchique du contenu avec HTML s=C3=A9mantique est une comp=C3=A9tence f=
ondamentale pour tout d=C3=A9veloppeur web. Elle permet de construire des p=
ages compr=C3=A9hensibles, accessibles, bien r=C3=A9f=C3=A9renc=C3=A9es, et=
 faciles =C3=A0 maintenir. En respectant ces principes, vous contribuez =C3=
=A0 un web plus accessible, performant et agr=C3=A9able =C3=A0 naviguer.</p=
>
