=3D"59" data-end=3D"97">l=E2=80=99accessibilit=C3=A9 s=C3=A9mantique en HTM=
L</strong>, couvrant tout, du niveau d=C3=A9butant =C3=A0 expert. L=E2=80=
=99accessibilit=C3=A9 est un pilier essentiel du web moderne, et la s=C3=A9=
mantique HTML est la base pour rendre vos pages accessibles =C3=A0 tous.</p=
>
<hr data-start=3D"276" data-end=3D"279">
<h1 data-start=3D"281" data-end=3D"319">L=E2=80=99accessibilit=C3=A9 s=C3=
=A9mantique en HTML</h1>
<p data-start=3D"320" data-end=3D"351"><strong data-start=3D"320" data-end=
=3D"351">Du niveau d=C3=A9butant =C3=A0 expert</strong></p>
<hr data-start=3D"353" data-end=3D"356">
<h2 data-start=3D"358" data-end=3D"405">1. Introduction =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99ac=
cessibilit=C3=A9 s=C3=A9mantique</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"407" data-end=3D"451">1.1. Qu=E2=80=99est-ce que l=E2=80=
=99accessibilit=C3=A9 web ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"453" data-end=3D"685">L=E2=80=99accessibilit=C3=A9 web (a1=
1y) d=C3=A9signe l=E2=80=99ensemble des bonnes pratiques permettant =C3=A0 =
tous les utilisateurs, notamment ceux en situation de handicap (visuel, mot=
eur, auditif, cognitif), d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A9der et de naviguer facilement s=
ur un site web.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"687" data-end=3D"759">1.2. Pourquoi la s=C3=A9mantique HT=
ML est cruciale pour l=E2=80=99accessibilit=C3=A9 ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"761" data-end=3D"864">Le HTML s=C3=A9mantique structure le=
 contenu avec des balises qui ont un sens clair et pr=C3=A9cis. Cela permet=
 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"866" data-end=3D"1166">
<li data-start=3D"866" data-end=3D"956">
<p data-start=3D"868" data-end=3D"956">Aux <strong data-start=3D"872" data-=
end=3D"892">lecteurs d=E2=80=99=C3=A9cran</strong> (technologies d=E2=80=99=
assistance) d=E2=80=99interpr=C3=A9ter correctement la page,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"957" data-end=3D"1021">
<p data-start=3D"959" data-end=3D"1021">Aux <strong data-start=3D"963" data=
-end=3D"987">moteurs de recherche</strong> de mieux comprendre la structure=
,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1022" data-end=3D"1106">
<p data-start=3D"1024" data-end=3D"1106">D=E2=80=99<strong data-start=3D"10=
26" data-end=3D"1053">am=C3=A9liorer la navigation</strong> (ex : sauts rap=
ides par titres, rep=C3=A9rage des zones),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1107" data-end=3D"1166">
<p data-start=3D"1109" data-end=3D"1166">De rendre le site utilisable m=C3=
=AAme sans CSS ni JavaScript.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1168" data-end=3D"1243">En r=C3=A9sum=C3=A9, la s=C3=A9man=
tique facilite la <strong data-start=3D"1205" data-end=3D"1222">compr=C3=A9=
hension</strong> du contenu par tous.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1245" data-end=3D"1248">
<h2 data-start=3D"1250" data-end=3D"1299">2. Bases de l=E2=80=99accessibili=
t=C3=A9 s=C3=A9mantique en HTML</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1301" data-end=3D"1349">2.1. Utiliser les bonnes balises =
s=C3=A9mantiques</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1351" data-end=3D"1668">
<li data-start=3D"1351" data-end=3D"1455">
<p data-start=3D"1353" data-end=3D"1455"><code data-start=3D"1353" data-end=
=3D"1363">&lt;header&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"1365" data-end=3D"1372=
">&lt;nav&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"1374" data-end=3D"1382">&lt;main&=
gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"1384" data-end=3D"1395">&lt;article&gt;</co=
de>, <code data-start=3D"1397" data-end=3D"1408">&lt;section&gt;</code>, <c=
ode data-start=3D"1410" data-end=3D"1419">&lt;aside&gt;</code>, <code data-=
start=3D"1421" data-end=3D"1431">&lt;footer&gt;</code> pour organiser la pa=
ge.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1456" data-end=3D"1503">
<p data-start=3D"1458" data-end=3D"1503"><code data-start=3D"1458" data-end=
=3D"1464">&lt;h1&gt;</code> =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"1467" data-end=3D"14=
73">&lt;h6&gt;</code> pour hi=C3=A9rarchiser les titres.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1504" data-end=3D"1533">
<p data-start=3D"1506" data-end=3D"1533"><code data-start=3D"1506" data-end=
=3D"1511">&lt;p&gt;</code> pour les paragraphes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1534" data-end=3D"1575">
<p data-start=3D"1536" data-end=3D"1575"><code data-start=3D"1536" data-end=
=3D"1542">&lt;ul&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"1544" data-end=3D"1550">&l=
t;ol&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"1552" data-end=3D"1558">&lt;li&gt;</co=
de> pour les listes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1576" data-end=3D"1668">
<p data-start=3D"1578" data-end=3D"1668"><code data-start=3D"1578" data-end=
=3D"1588">&lt;button&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"1590" data-end=3D"1598=
">&lt;form&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"1600" data-end=3D"1609">&lt;inpu=
t&gt;</code>, <code data-start=3D"1611" data-end=3D"1620">&lt;label&gt;</co=
de>, <code data-start=3D"1622" data-end=3D"1634">&lt;fieldset&gt;</code>, <=
code data-start=3D"1636" data-end=3D"1646">&lt;legend&gt;</code> pour les f=
ormulaires.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1670" data-end=3D"1803"><strong data-start=3D"1670" data-e=
nd=3D"1745">Ne jamais remplacer ces balises par des <code data-start=3D"171=
2" data-end=3D"1719">&lt;div&gt;</code> ou <code data-start=3D"1723" data-e=
nd=3D"1731">&lt;span&gt;</code> sans raison</strong>, car ces derni=C3=A8re=
s n=E2=80=99ont pas de signification s=C3=A9mantique.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1805" data-end=3D"1841">2.2. Titres et navigation claire<=
/h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1843" data-end=3D"2051">
<li data-start=3D"1843" data-end=3D"1890">
<p data-start=3D"1845" data-end=3D"1890">Un seul <code data-start=3D"1853" =
data-end=3D"1859">&lt;h1&gt;</code> par page, clair et descriptif.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1891" data-end=3D"1993">
<p data-start=3D"1893" data-end=3D"1993">Utiliser les titres dans l=E2=80=
=99ordre logique pour permettre aux lecteurs d=E2=80=99=C3=A9cran de navigu=
er facilement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1994" data-end=3D"2051">
<p data-start=3D"1996" data-end=3D"2051">Un <code data-start=3D"1999" data-=
end=3D"2006">&lt;nav&gt;</code> distinct contenant la navigation principale=
.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2053" data-end=3D"2056">
<h2 data-start=3D"2058" data-end=3D"2125">3. Techniques avanc=C3=A9es pour =
am=C3=A9liorer l=E2=80=99accessibilit=C3=A9 s=C3=A9mantique</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2127" data-end=3D"2199">3.1. R=C3=B4le des attributs ARIA=
 (Accessible Rich Internet Applications)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2201" data-end=3D"2340">Lorsque le HTML s=C3=A9mantique na=
tif ne suffit pas (ex : widgets complexes), on peut utiliser des attributs =
ARIA pour ajouter de la s=C3=A9mantique.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2342" data-end=3D"2703">
<li data-start=3D"2342" data-end=3D"2446">
<p data-start=3D"2344" data-end=3D"2446"><code data-start=3D"2344" data-end=
=3D"2350">role</code> : pour d=C3=A9finir le r=C3=B4le d=E2=80=99un =C3=A9l=
=C3=A9ment (ex : <code data-start=3D"2393" data-end=3D"2412">role=3D"naviga=
tion"</code>, <code data-start=3D"2414" data-end=3D"2427">role=3D"main"</co=
de>, <code data-start=3D"2429" data-end=3D"2444">role=3D"button"</code>).</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2447" data-end=3D"2524">
<p data-start=3D"2449" data-end=3D"2524"><code data-start=3D"2449" data-end=
=3D"2461">aria-label</code> et <code data-start=3D"2465" data-end=3D"2482">=
aria-labelledby</code> : pour fournir des =C3=A9tiquettes textuelles.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2525" data-end=3D"2572">
<p data-start=3D"2527" data-end=3D"2572"><code data-start=3D"2527" data-end=
=3D"2545">aria-describedby</code> : pour d=C3=A9crire un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2573" data-end=3D"2646">
<p data-start=3D"2575" data-end=3D"2646"><code data-start=3D"2575" data-end=
=3D"2595">aria-hidden=3D"true"</code> : cacher un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment aux tec=
hnologies d=E2=80=99assistance.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2647" data-end=3D"2703">
<p data-start=3D"2649" data-end=3D"2703"><code data-start=3D"2649" data-end=
=3D"2660">aria-live</code> : annoncer dynamiquement les mises =C3=A0 jour.<=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2705" data-end=3D"2785"><strong data-start=3D"2705" data-e=
nd=3D"2720">Attention :</strong> ARIA ne remplace pas le HTML s=C3=A9mantiq=
ue natif, mais le compl=C3=A8te.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2787" data-end=3D"2826">3.2. Labels et champs de formulai=
re</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2828" data-end=3D"3083">
<li data-start=3D"2828" data-end=3D"2908">
<p data-start=3D"2830" data-end=3D"2908">Toujours associer un <code data-st=
art=3D"2851" data-end=3D"2860">&lt;label&gt;</code> explicite =C3=A0 chaque=
 champ avec l=E2=80=99attribut <code data-start=3D"2902" data-end=3D"2907">=
for</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2909" data-end=3D"2980">
<p data-start=3D"2911" data-end=3D"2980">Utiliser <code data-start=3D"2920"=
 data-end=3D"2932">&lt;fieldset&gt;</code> et <code data-start=3D"2936" dat=
a-end=3D"2946">&lt;legend&gt;</code> pour grouper des champs connexes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2981" data-end=3D"3083">
<p data-start=3D"2983" data-end=3D"3083">Pour des contr=C3=B4les complexes =
(ex : sliders, menus d=C3=A9roulants personnalis=C3=A9s), ajouter ARIA si b=
esoin.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3085" data-end=3D"3133">3.3. Gestion des =C3=A9tats inter=
actifs avec ARIA</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3135" data-end=3D"3314">
<li data-start=3D"3135" data-end=3D"3223">
<p data-start=3D"3137" data-end=3D"3223">Indiquer quand un =C3=A9l=C3=A9men=
t est activ=C3=A9/d=C3=A9sactiv=C3=A9 (<code data-start=3D"3185" data-end=
=3D"3199">aria-checked</code>, <code data-start=3D"3201" data-end=3D"3216">=
aria-expanded</code>, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3224" data-end=3D"3314">
<p data-start=3D"3226" data-end=3D"3314">Annoncer les changements dynamique=
s (ex : contenu modal, notification) avec <code data-start=3D"3302" data-en=
d=3D"3313">aria-live</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3316" data-end=3D"3319">
<h2 data-start=3D"3321" data-end=3D"3376">4. Bonnes pratiques pour la navig=
ation et la lecture</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3378" data-end=3D"3432">4.1. Ordre du DOM coh=C3=A9rent a=
vec l=E2=80=99affichage visuel</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3434" data-end=3D"3614">L=E2=80=99ordre des =C3=A9l=C3=A9m=
ents dans le code source doit correspondre =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99ordre logique d=
e lecture. Eviter d=E2=80=99avoir un menu plac=C3=A9 en bas dans le DOM alo=
rs qu=E2=80=99il s=E2=80=99affiche en haut visuellement.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3616" data-end=3D"3661">4.2. Points d=E2=80=99ancrage et =
sauts de contenu</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3663" data-end=3D"3848">
<li data-start=3D"3663" data-end=3D"3799">
<p data-start=3D"3665" data-end=3D"3799">Ajouter un lien "Passer au contenu=
" (<code data-start=3D"3702" data-end=3D"3713">skip link</code>) en d=C3=A9=
but de page pour permettre aux utilisateurs au clavier de sauter la navigat=
ion.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3800" data-end=3D"3848">
<p data-start=3D"3802" data-end=3D"3848">Utiliser des ancres et titres bien=
 structur=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3850" data-end=3D"3853">
<h2 data-start=3D"3855" data-end=3D"3882">5. Couleurs et contraste</h2>
<p data-start=3D"3884" data-end=3D"4124">M=C3=AAme si ce n=E2=80=99est pas =
strictement du HTML, il est important de garder =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99esprit que=
 le contenu s=C3=A9mantique doit =C3=AAtre compl=C3=A9t=C3=A9 par un contra=
ste suffisant entre le texte et le fond pour que les personnes malvoyantes =
puissent lire correctement.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4126" data-end=3D"4129">
<h2 data-start=3D"4131" data-end=3D"4182">6. Outils pour tester l=E2=80=99a=
ccessibilit=C3=A9 s=C3=A9mantique</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"4184" data-end=3D"4483">
<li data-start=3D"4184" data-end=3D"4250">
<p data-start=3D"4186" data-end=3D"4250"><strong data-start=3D"4186" data-e=
nd=3D"4194">WAVE</strong> (wave.webaim.org) : outil d=E2=80=99audit visuel =
et s=C3=A9mantique.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4251" data-end=3D"4323">
<p data-start=3D"4253" data-end=3D"4323"><strong data-start=3D"4253" data-e=
nd=3D"4269">axe DevTools</strong> : extension navigateur pour analyser l=E2=
=80=99accessibilit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4324" data-end=3D"4403">
<p data-start=3D"4326" data-end=3D"4403"><strong data-start=3D"4326" data-e=
nd=3D"4334">NVDA</strong> ou <strong data-start=3D"4338" data-end=3D"4351">=
VoiceOver</strong> : lecteurs d=E2=80=99=C3=A9cran gratuits pour tester la =
lecture.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4404" data-end=3D"4483">
<p data-start=3D"4406" data-end=3D"4483"><strong data-start=3D"4406" data-e=
nd=3D"4427">Google Lighthouse</strong> : audit automatis=C3=A9 d=E2=80=99ac=
cessibilit=C3=A9 et bonnes pratiques.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4485" data-end=3D"4488">
