<hr data-start=3D"5479" data-end=3D"5482">
<h2 data-start=3D"5484" data-end=3D"5517">8. Erreurs fr=C3=A9quentes =C3=A0=
 =C3=A9viter</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5519" data-end=3D"5819">
<li data-start=3D"5519" data-end=3D"5575">
<p data-start=3D"5521" data-end=3D"5575">Utiliser des <code data-start=3D"5=
534" data-end=3D"5541">&lt;div&gt;</code> partout sans balises s=C3=A9manti=
ques.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5576" data-end=3D"5637">
<p data-start=3D"5578" data-end=3D"5637">Omettre les titres ou les utiliser=
 dans un ordre incorrect.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5638" data-end=3D"5695">
<p data-start=3D"5640" data-end=3D"5695">Ne pas associer les <code data-sta=
rt=3D"5660" data-end=3D"5669">&lt;label&gt;</code> aux champs de formulaire=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5696" data-end=3D"5758">
<p data-start=3D"5698" data-end=3D"5758">Ajouter des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments int=
eractifs non accessibles au clavier.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5759" data-end=3D"5819">
<p data-start=3D"5761" data-end=3D"5819">Ajouter trop d=E2=80=99attributs A=
RIA inutiles ou contradictoires.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5821" data-end=3D"5824">
<h2 data-start=3D"5826" data-end=3D"5889">9. Aller plus loin : accessibilit=
=C3=A9 dynamique avec JavaScript</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5891" data-end=3D"6089">
<li data-start=3D"5891" data-end=3D"5954">
<p data-start=3D"5893" data-end=3D"5954">Mettre =C3=A0 jour les r=C3=B4les =
ARIA lors des changements dynamiques.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5955" data-end=3D"6023">
<p data-start=3D"5957" data-end=3D"6023">G=C3=A9rer le focus de mani=C3=A8r=
e appropri=C3=A9e (ex : focus dans les modals).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6024" data-end=3D"6089">
<p data-start=3D"6026" data-end=3D"6089">Annoncer les changements de conten=
u importants via <code data-start=3D"6077" data-end=3D"6088">aria-live</cod=
e>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6091" data-end=3D"6094">
<h2 data-start=3D"6096" data-end=3D"6113">10. Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6115" data-end=3D"6269">L=E2=80=99accessibilit=C3=A9 s=C3=
=A9mantique n=E2=80=99est pas qu=E2=80=99une option : c=E2=80=99est une res=
ponsabilit=C3=A9 pour rendre le web inclusif, utilisable par tous, et durab=
le. En combinant :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6271" data-end=3D"6396">
<li data-start=3D"6271" data-end=3D"6302">
<p data-start=3D"6273" data-end=3D"6302">Un HTML s=C3=A9mantique rigoureux,=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6303" data-end=3D"6339">
<p data-start=3D"6305" data-end=3D"6339">Une utilisation judicieuse d=E2=80=
=99ARIA,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6340" data-end=3D"6396">
<p data-start=3D"6342" data-end=3D"6396">Une attention aux bonnes pratiques=
 et tests r=C3=A9guliers,</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6398" data-end=3D"6489">vous cr=C3=A9erez des sites non se=
ulement accessibles, mais aussi mieux structur=C3=A9s et optimis=C3=A9s.</p=
