<hr data-start=3D"3923" data-end=3D"3926">
<h2 data-start=3D"3928" data-end=3D"3959">7. Bonnes pratiques avanc=C3=A9es=
</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3961" data-end=3D"3996">7.1. Nommage clair et structur=C3=
=A9</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3998" data-end=3D"4154">
<li data-start=3D"3998" data-end=3D"4076">
<p data-start=3D"4000" data-end=3D"4076">Pr=C3=A9fixer les variables par le=
ur usage : <code data-start=3D"4040" data-end=3D"4050">--color-</code>, <co=
de data-start=3D"4052" data-end=3D"4061">--font-</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"4063" data-end=3D"4075">--spacing-</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4077" data-end=3D"4154">
<p data-start=3D"4079" data-end=3D"4154">Utiliser des noms explicites, par =
ex. <code data-start=3D"4117" data-end=3D"4134">--color-primary</code>, <co=
de data-start=3D"4136" data-end=3D"4153">--spacing-large</code>.</p>
