<h3 data-start=3D"3822" data-end=3D"3860">4.4. Pourquoi utiliser <code data=
-start=3D"3849" data-end=3D"3858">clamp()</code> ?</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3862" data-end=3D"4055">
<li data-start=3D"3862" data-end=3D"3905">
