<hr data-start=3D"2960" data-end=3D"2963">
<h2 data-start=3D"2965" data-end=3D"2989">5. Transformations 3D</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2991" data-end=3D"3057">5.1. <code data-start=3D"3000" da=
ta-end=3D"3014">translateZ()</code>, <code data-start=3D"3016" data-end=3D"=
3027">rotateX()</code>, <code data-start=3D"3029" data-end=3D"3040">rotateY=
()</code>, <code data-start=3D"3042" data-end=3D"3057">perspective()</code>=
</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3059" data-end=3D"3105">Les transformations 3D ajoutent la=
 profondeur.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3107" data-end=3D"3354">
<li data-start=3D"3107" data-end=3D"3168">
<p data-start=3D"3109" data-end=3D"3168"><code data-start=3D"3109" data-end=
=3D"3125">translateZ(px)</code> : translation sur l=E2=80=99axe Z (avant/ar=
ri=C3=A8re),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3169" data-end=3D"3259">
<p data-start=3D"3171" data-end=3D"3259"><code data-start=3D"3171" data-end=
=3D"3185">rotateX(deg)</code>, <code data-start=3D"3187" data-end=3D"3201">=
rotateY(deg)</code> : rotation selon les axes X (horizontal) et Y (vertical=
),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3260" data-end=3D"3354">
<p data-start=3D"3262" data-end=3D"3354"><code data-start=3D"3262" data-end=
=3D"3279">perspective(px)</code> : donne l=E2=80=99effet de perspective (di=
stance virtuelle entre cam=C3=A9ra et objet).</p>
</li>
</ul>
