<li data-start=3D"1244" data-end=3D"1276">
<p data-start=3D"1246" data-end=3D"1276">la ou les propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s =C3=
=A0 animer,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1277" data-end=3D"1305">
<p data-start=3D"1279" data-end=3D"1305">la dur=C3=A9e de la transition,</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1306" data-end=3D"1355">
<p data-start=3D"1308" data-end=3D"1355">la fonction de temporisation (timi=
ng function),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1356" data-end=3D"1382">
<p data-start=3D"1358" data-end=3D"1382">le d=C3=A9lai avant le d=C3=A9but.=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
