">transition</span></span><span>: all </span><span><span class=3D"hljs-numb=
er">0.4s</span></span><span> ease;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start=3D"2414" data-end=3D"2514">Attention, utiliser <code data-sta=
rt=3D"2434" data-end=3D"2439">all</code> peut impacter la performance s=E2=
=80=99il y a beaucoup de propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s =C3=A0 surveiller.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2516" data-end=3D"2519">
<h2 data-start=3D"2521" data-end=3D"2572">3. Fonction de temporisation (<co=
de data-start=3D"2554" data-end=3D"2571">timing-function</code>)</h2>
<p data-start=3D"2574" data-end=3D"2667">La fonction de temporisation d=C3=
=A9finit comment la vitesse de la transition varie dans le temps.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2669" data-end=3D"2938">
<li data-start=3D"2669" data-end=3D"2700">
<p data-start=3D"2671" data-end=3D"2700"><code data-start=3D"2671" data-end=
=3D"2679">linear</code> : vitesse constante,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2701" data-end=3D"2768">
<p data-start=3D"2703" data-end=3D"2768"><code data-start=3D"2703" data-end=
=3D"2709">ease</code> (par d=C3=A9faut) : d=C3=A9marre lentement, acc=C3=A9=
l=C3=A8re, puis ralentit,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2769" data-end=3D"2801">
<p data-start=3D"2771" data-end=3D"2801"><code data-start=3D"2771" data-end=
=3D"2780">ease-in</code> : d=C3=A9marre lentement,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2802" data-end=3D"2833">
<p data-start=3D"2804" data-end=3D"2833"><code data-start=3D"2804" data-end=
=3D"2814">ease-out</code> : finit lentement,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2834" data-end=3D"2879">
<p data-start=3D"2836" data-end=3D"2879"><code data-start=3D"2836" data-end=
=3D"2849">ease-in-out</code> : d=C3=A9marre et finit lentement,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2880" data-end=3D"2938">
<p data-start=3D"2882" data-end=3D"2938"><code data-start=3D"2882" data-end=
=3D"2912">cubic-bezier(x1, y1, x2, y2)</code> : fonction personnalis=C3=A9e=
.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2940" data-end=3D"2943">
<h2 data-start=3D"2945" data-end=3D"2986">4. Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s animables=
 par transition</h2>
<p data-start=3D"2988" data-end=3D"3078">Certaines propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s CSS=
 ne sont pas animables. Voici des exemples d=E2=80=99animables courantes :<=
/p>
<ul data-start=3D"3080" data-end=3D"3341">
<li data-start=3D"3080" data-end=3D"3156">
<p data-start=3D"3082" data-end=3D"3156">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s de couleur (<=
code data-start=3D"3105" data-end=3D"3112">color</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"3114" data-end=3D"3132">background-color</code>, <code data-start=3D"31=
34" data-end=3D"3148">border-color</code>, etc.),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3157" data-end=3D"3224">
<p data-start=3D"3159" data-end=3D"3224">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s de dimension =
(<code data-start=3D"3184" data-end=3D"3191">width</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"3193" data-end=3D"3201">height</code>, <code data-start=3D"3203" data-e=
nd=3D"3211">margin</code>, <code data-start=3D"3213" data-end=3D"3222">padd=
ing</code>),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3225" data-end=3D"3272">
<p data-start=3D"3227" data-end=3D"3272">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s de position (=
<code data-start=3D"3251" data-end=3D"3256">top</code>, <code data-start=3D=
"3258" data-end=3D"3264">left</code>, etc.),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3273" data-end=3D"3318">
<p data-start=3D"3275" data-end=3D"3318">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s de transforma=
tion (<code data-start=3D"3305" data-end=3D"3316">transform</code>),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3319" data-end=3D"3341">
<p data-start=3D"3321" data-end=3D"3341">Opacit=C3=A9 (<code data-start=3D"=
3330" data-end=3D"3339">opacity</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3343" data-end=3D"3346">
<h2 data-start=3D"3348" data-end=3D"3381">5. Limitations des transitions</h=
2>
<ul data-start=3D"3383" data-end=3D"3542">
<li data-start=3D"3383" data-end=3D"3445">
<p data-start=3D"3385" data-end=3D"3445">Transition entre deux =C3=A9tats u=
niquement (ex. normal =E2=86=92 hover),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3446" data-end=3D"3487">
<p data-start=3D"3448" data-end=3D"3487">Pas de s=C3=A9quences complexes ou=
 r=C3=A9p=C3=A9t=C3=A9es,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3488" data-end=3D"3542">
<p data-start=3D"3490" data-end=3D"3542">Pas de contr=C3=B4le sur plusieurs=
 =C3=A9tapes interm=C3=A9diaires.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3544" data-end=3D"3547">
<h2 data-start=3D"3549" data-end=3D"3587">6. Animations CSS avec <code data=
-start=3D"3575" data-end=3D"3587">@keyframes</code></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3589" data-end=3D"3630">6.1. Qu=E2=80=99est-ce qu=E2=80=
=99une animation CSS ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3632" data-end=3D"3796">Une animation CSS permet de d=C3=
=A9finir une s=C3=A9quence de transformations, r=C3=A9p=C3=A9titions, et co=
ntr=C3=B4les fins de la temporalit=C3=A9 via des <strong data-start=3D"3758=
" data-end=3D"3771">keyframes</strong> (=C3=A9tapes interm=C3=A9diaires).</=
p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3798" data-end=3D"3828">6.2. Syntaxe des keyframes</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3830" data-end=3D"3913">On d=C3=A9finit des =C3=A9tapes cl=
