ode>, <code data-start=3D"5112" data-end=3D"5120">sticky</code> activent la=
 propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5145" data-end=3D"5148">
<h2 data-start=3D"5150" data-end=3D"5199">7. Ordre d=E2=80=99empilement com=
plet (stacking order)</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5201" data-end=3D"5290">Dans un m=C3=AAme contexte d=E2=80=
=99empilement, l=E2=80=99ordre d=E2=80=99empilement est le suivant, de bas =
en haut :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"5292" data-end=3D"5585">
<li data-start=3D"5292" data-end=3D"5342">
<p data-start=3D"5295" data-end=3D"5342">Le <strong data-start=3D"5298" dat=
a-end=3D"5312">background</strong> et les bordures du conteneur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5343" data-end=3D"5383">
<p data-start=3D"5346" data-end=3D"5383">Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments avec <code =
data-start=3D"5364" data-end=3D"5373">z-index</code> n=C3=A9gatifs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5384" data-end=3D"5444">
<p data-start=3D"5387" data-end=3D"5444">Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments normaux (sa=
ns <code data-start=3D"5414" data-end=3D"5423">z-index</code> ou <code data=
-start=3D"5427" data-end=3D"5442">z-index: auto</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5445" data-end=3D"5484">
<p data-start=3D"5448" data-end=3D"5484">Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments avec <code =
data-start=3D"5466" data-end=3D"5475">z-index</code> positif.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5485" data-end=3D"5585">
<p data-start=3D"5488" data-end=3D"5585">Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments en position=
 <code data-start=3D"5513" data-end=3D"5520">fixed</code> ou <code data-sta=
rt=3D"5524" data-end=3D"5532">sticky</code> hors flux (ils cr=C3=A9ent souv=
ent leur propre contexte).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"5587" data-end=3D"5590">
<h2 data-start=3D"5592" data-end=3D"5631">8. Cas complexes et pi=C3=A8ges f=
