<h2 data-start=3D"257" data-end=3D"302">1. Introduction aux propri=C3=A9t=
=C3=A9s raccourcies</h2>
<p data-start=3D"304" data-end=3D"642">En CSS, certaines propri=C3=A9t=C3=
=A9s peuvent =C3=AAtre d=C3=A9finies via plusieurs propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s lon=
