<p data-start=3D"768" data-end=3D"834"><strong data-start=3D"768" data-end=
=3D"783">Performance</strong> : Moins de code =C3=A0 parser (minime gain ma=
is utile).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"835" data-end=3D"917">
<p data-start=3D"837" data-end=3D"917"><strong data-start=3D"837" data-end=
=3D"858">Gestion coh=C3=A9rente</strong> : On modifie plusieurs propri=C3=
=A9t=C3=A9s li=C3=A9es en une seule fois.</p>
</li>
</ul>
