<hr data-start=3D"7042" data-end=3D"7045">
<h2 data-start=3D"7047" data-end=3D"7104">11. Bonus : gestion des =C3=A9tat=
s d=E2=80=99interaction sur mobile</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"7106" data-end=3D"7333">
<li data-start=3D"7106" data-end=3D"7172">
<p data-start=3D"7108" data-end=3D"7172">Sur mobile, <code data-start=3D"71=
20" data-end=3D"7128">:hover</code> ne fonctionne pas vraiment (pas de sour=
is).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7173" data-end=3D"7238">
<p data-start=3D"7175" data-end=3D"7238">Utiliser <code data-start=3D"7184"=
 data-end=3D"7192">:focus</code> ou JavaScript pour les interactions tactil=
es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7239" data-end=3D"7333">
<p data-start=3D"7241" data-end=3D"7333">Certaines techniques : <code data-=
start=3D"7264" data-end=3D"7276">touchstart</code>/<code data-start=3D"7277=
" data-end=3D"7287">touchend</code> en JS ou focus pour les =C3=A9l=C3=A9me=
nts interactifs.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7335" data-end=3D"7338">
<h2 data-start=3D"7340" data-end=3D"7357">12. Conclusion</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"7359" data-end=3D"7787">
<li data-start=3D"7359" data-end=3D"7433">
<p data-start=3D"7361" data-end=3D"7433">La gestion des =C3=A9tats d=E2=80=
=99interaction en CSS repose sur les pseudo-classes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7434" data-end=3D"7490">
<p data-start=3D"7436" data-end=3D"7490"><code data-start=3D"7436" data-end=
=3D"7444">:hover</code>, <code data-start=3D"7446" data-end=3D"7454">:focus=
</code>, <code data-start=3D"7456" data-end=3D"7465">:active</code> sont le=
s plus utilis=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7491" data-end=3D"7547">
<p data-start=3D"7493" data-end=3D"7547">L=E2=80=99accessibilit=C3=A9 impos=
e de bien g=C3=A9rer le focus visible.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7548" data-end=3D"7629">
<p data-start=3D"7550" data-end=3D"7629">Les pseudo-classes avanc=C3=A9es p=
ermettent des styles conditionnels plus complexes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7630" data-end=3D"7712">
<p data-start=3D"7632" data-end=3D"7712">Pour des interactions plus pouss=
=C3=A9es, la combinaison CSS + JavaScript est la cl=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7713" data-end=3D"7787">
<p data-start=3D"7715" data-end=3D"7787">Tester les =C3=A9tats sur plusieur=
s devices et navigateurs est indispensable.</p>
</li>
</ul>
