<li data-start=3D"787" data-end=3D"829">
<p data-start=3D"789" data-end=3D"829">De favoriser la r=C3=A9utilisabilit=
=C3=A9 du code.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"830" data-end=3D"866">
<p data-start=3D"832" data-end=3D"866">De faciliter le travail en =C3=A9qui=
pe.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"867" data-end=3D"910">
<p data-start=3D"869" data-end=3D"910">De g=C3=A9rer la modularit=C3=A9 et =
la scalabilit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"911" data-end=3D"975">
<p data-start=3D"913" data-end=3D"975">D=E2=80=99optimiser la performance v=
ia le d=C3=A9coupage et la compilation.</p>
</li>
</ul>
