<h3 data-start=3D"3792" data-end=3D"3807">Avantages :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3809" data-end=3D"4069">
<li data-start=3D"3809" data-end=3D"3836">
<p data-start=3D"3811" data-end=3D"3836">Modulaire et maintenable.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3837" data-end=3D"3905">
<p data-start=3D"3839" data-end=3D"3905">Possibilit=C3=A9 de d=C3=A9finir v=
ariables, mixins, fonctions r=C3=A9utilisables.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3906" data-end=3D"3952">
<p data-start=3D"3908" data-end=3D"3952">Compilation en un seul fichier CSS=
 optimis=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3953" data-end=3D"4013">
<p data-start=3D"3955" data-end=3D"4013">Possibilit=C3=A9 d=E2=80=99utilise=
r la <strong data-start=3D"3981" data-end=3D"4001">nomenclature BEM</strong=
> facilement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4014" data-end=3D"4069">
<p data-start=3D"4016" data-end=3D"4069">Facilite la gestion des th=C3=A8me=
s (variables, couleurs).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4071" data-end=3D"4103">Bonnes pratiques avec Sass :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4105" data-end=3D"4326">
<li data-start=3D"4105" data-end=3D"4165">
<p data-start=3D"4107" data-end=3D"4165">Regrouper les variables dans un fi=
chier <code data-start=3D"4147" data-end=3D"4164">_variables.scss</code>.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4166" data-end=3D"4219">
<p data-start=3D"4168" data-end=3D"4219">Mettre les fonctions et mixins dan=
s <code data-start=3D"4204" data-end=3D"4218">_mixins.scss</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4220" data-end=3D"4266">
<p data-start=3D"4222" data-end=3D"4266">Organiser les composants par fonct=
ionnalit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4267" data-end=3D"4326">
<p data-start=3D"4269" data-end=3D"4326">Limiter la taille des partials pou=
r faciliter la lecture.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4328" data-end=3D"4331">
<h2 data-start=3D"4333" data-end=3D"4399">5. Approche modulaire avec CSS mo=
derne : CSS Modules, CSS-in-JS</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4401" data-end=3D"4419">Niveau expert+</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4421" data-end=3D"4501">Pour des projets JavaScript modern=
es (React, Vue, Angular), on utilise souvent :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4503" data-end=3D"4662">
<li data-start=3D"4503" data-end=3D"4581">
<p data-start=3D"4505" data-end=3D"4581"><strong data-start=3D"4505" data-e=
nd=3D"4520">CSS Modules</strong> : chaque composant a son fichier CSS local=
, isol=C3=A9 par scope.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4582" data-end=3D"4662">
<p data-start=3D"4584" data-end=3D"4662"><strong data-start=3D"4584" data-e=
nd=3D"4597">CSS-in-JS</strong> : styles =C3=A9crits directement en JavaScri=
pt, scoped par composant.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4664" data-end=3D"4677">Cela permet :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4679" data-end=3D"4859">
<li data-start=3D"4679" data-end=3D"4710">
<p data-start=3D"4681" data-end=3D"4710">D=E2=80=99=C3=A9viter les conflits=
 de nom.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4711" data-end=3D"4757">
<p data-start=3D"4713" data-end=3D"4757">D=E2=80=99associer styles et compo=
sants logiquement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4758" data-end=3D"4796">
<p data-start=3D"4760" data-end=3D"4796">De charger dynamiquement les style=
s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4797" data-end=3D"4859">
<p data-start=3D"4799" data-end=3D"4859">De b=C3=A9n=C3=A9ficier d=E2=80=99=
outils puissants comme le theming dynamique.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4861" data-end=3D"4864">
<h2 data-start=3D"4866" data-end=3D"4910">6. Strat=C3=A9gies d=E2=80=99orga=
