<h3 data-start=3D"5479" data-end=3D"5538">6.3. Garder un style coh=C3=A9ren=
t dans l=E2=80=99ordre des fichiers</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5540" data-end=3D"5677">
<li data-start=3D"5540" data-end=3D"5611">
<p data-start=3D"5542" data-end=3D"5611">Variables =E2=86=92 Reset =E2=86=
=92 Base =E2=86=92 Layout =E2=86=92 Composants =E2=86=92 Pages =E2=86=92 Ut=
ilitaires.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5612" data-end=3D"5677">
<p data-start=3D"5614" data-end=3D"5677">Cette hi=C3=A9rarchie refl=C3=A8te=
 la logique de construction des styles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5679" data-end=3D"5682">
<h2 data-start=3D"5684" data-end=3D"5736">7. Conseils pour la maintenance e=
t la scalabilit=C3=A9</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5738" data-end=3D"6177">
<li data-start=3D"5738" data-end=3D"5782">
<p data-start=3D"5740" data-end=3D"5782"><strong data-start=3D"5740" data-e=
nd=3D"5763">Commentaires clairs</strong> dans les fichiers.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5783" data-end=3D"5821">
<p data-start=3D"5785" data-end=3D"5821"><strong data-start=3D"5785" data-e=
nd=3D"5810">=C3=89viter la duplication</strong> de styles.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5822" data-end=3D"5903">
<p data-start=3D"5824" data-end=3D"5903"><strong data-start=3D"5824" data-e=
nd=3D"5846">Nommer pr=C3=A9cis=C3=A9ment</strong> les fichiers (ex : <code =
data-start=3D"5866" data-end=3D"5880">_header.scss</code> et pas <code data=
-start=3D"5888" data-end=3D"5901">style1.scss</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5904" data-end=3D"5963">
<p data-start=3D"5906" data-end=3D"5963"><strong data-start=3D"5906" data-e=
nd=3D"5921">Modulariser</strong> au maximum pour isoler les modifications.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5964" data-end=3D"6013">
<p data-start=3D"5966" data-end=3D"6013"><strong data-start=3D"5966" data-e=
nd=3D"5980">Documenter</strong> la structure CSS dans le projet.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6014" data-end=3D"6093">
<p data-start=3D"6016" data-end=3D"6093">Utiliser des outils de <strong dat=
a-start=3D"6039" data-end=3D"6054">linting CSS</strong> (stylelint) pour un=
iformiser le style.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6094" data-end=3D"6177">
<p data-start=3D"6096" data-end=3D"6177">Penser au <strong data-start=3D"61=
06" data-end=3D"6120">versioning</strong> des fichiers et au <strong data-s=
tart=3D"6140" data-end=3D"6157">cache busting</strong> pour la production.<=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6179" data-end=3D"6182">
<h2 data-start=3D"6184" data-end=3D"6214">8. Optimisation et bundling</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6216" data-end=3D"6555">
<li data-start=3D"6216" data-end=3D"6323">
<p data-start=3D"6218" data-end=3D"6323">En production, regrouper les fichi=
ers CSS en un seul (ou peu de fichiers) pour limiter les requ=C3=AAtes HTTP=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6324" data-end=3D"6455">
<p data-start=3D"6326" data-end=3D"6455">Utiliser des outils comme <strong =
data-start=3D"6352" data-end=3D"6363">Webpack</strong>, <strong data-start=
=3D"6365" data-end=3D"6375">Parcel</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"6377" da=
ta-end=3D"6385">Vite</strong>, ou des task runners (<strong data-start=3D"6=
408" data-end=3D"6416">Gulp</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"6418" data-end=
=3D"6427">Grunt</strong>) pour compiler et minifier.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6456" data-end=3D"6555">
<p data-start=3D"6458" data-end=3D"6555">Int=C3=A9grer la gestion du cache =
avec des noms de fichiers contenant des hashes (<code data-start=3D"6535" d=
ata-end=3D"6553">style.abc123.css</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6557" data-end=3D"6560">
