<h3 data-start=3D"3701" data-end=3D"3719">3.4. Avantages</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3721" data-end=3D"3868">
<li data-start=3D"3721" data-end=3D"3760">
<p data-start=3D"3723" data-end=3D"3760">R=C3=A9utilisabilit=C3=A9 maximale=
 des classes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3761" data-end=3D"3801">
<p data-start=3D"3763" data-end=3D"3801">S=C3=A9paration claire des respons=
abilit=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3802" data-end=3D"3843">
<p data-start=3D"3804" data-end=3D"3843">Facilite la gestion des th=C3=A8me=
s (peaux).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3844" data-end=3D"3868">
<p data-start=3D"3846" data-end=3D"3868">Limite la duplication.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3870" data-end=3D"3892">3.5. Inconv=C3=A9nients</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3894" data-end=3D"4026">
<li data-start=3D"3894" data-end=3D"3933">
<p data-start=3D"3896" data-end=3D"3933">Peut =C3=AAtre complexe =C3=A0 met=
tre en place.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3934" data-end=3D"3982">
<p data-start=3D"3936" data-end=3D"3982">Le nommage peut =C3=AAtre moins in=
tuitif au d=C3=A9part.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3983" data-end=3D"4026">
<p data-start=3D"3985" data-end=3D"4026">N=C3=A9cessite un bon d=C3=A9coupa=
ge en objets CSS.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4028" data-end=3D"4031">
<h2 data-start=3D"4033" data-end=3D"4089">4. SMACSS : Scalable and Modular =
Architecture for CSS</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4091" data-end=3D"4112">4.1. Pr=C3=A9sentation</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4114" data-end=3D"4257">SMACSS est une m=C3=A9thodologie c=
on=C3=A7ue par Jonathan Snook pour organiser le CSS en cat=C3=A9gories afin=
 d=E2=80=99am=C3=A9liorer la scalabilit=C3=A9 et la maintenabilit=C3=A9.</p=
>
<h3 data-start=3D"4259" data-end=3D"4291">4.2. Les 5 cat=C3=A9gories SMACSS=
</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"4293" data-end=3D"4653">
<li data-start=3D"4293" data-end=3D"4369">
<p data-start=3D"4296" data-end=3D"4369"><strong data-start=3D"4296" data-e=
nd=3D"4304">Base</strong> : styles par d=C3=A9faut des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments H=
TML (<code data-start=3D"4344" data-end=3D"4350">body</code>, <code data-st=
art=3D"4352" data-end=3D"4356">h1</code>, <code data-start=3D"4358" data-en=
d=3D"4361">p</code>, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4370" data-end=3D"4462">
<p data-start=3D"4373" data-end=3D"4462"><strong data-start=3D"4373" data-e=
nd=3D"4383">Layout</strong> : grandes sections de la page, zones globales (=
<code data-start=3D"4431" data-end=3D"4439">header</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"4441" data-end=3D"4449">footer</code>, <code data-start=3D"4451" data-e=
nd=3D"4460">sidebar</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4463" data-end=3D"4531">
<p data-start=3D"4466" data-end=3D"4531"><strong data-start=3D"4466" data-e=
nd=3D"4476">Module</strong> : composants r=C3=A9utilisables (boutons, carte=
s, sliders).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4532" data-end=3D"4598">
<p data-start=3D"4535" data-end=3D"4598"><strong data-start=3D"4535" data-e=
nd=3D"4544">State</strong> : =C3=A9tats des modules (<code data-start=3D"45=
66" data-end=3D"4577">is-active</code>, <code data-start=3D"4579" data-end=
=3D"4590">is-hidden</code>, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4599" data-end=3D"4653">
<p data-start=3D"4602" data-end=3D"4653"><strong data-start=3D"4602" data-e=
nd=3D"4611">Theme</strong> : th=C3=A8mes visuels, variations d=E2=80=99appa=
rence.</p>
</li>
</ol>
