<hr data-start=3D"6507" data-end=3D"6510">
<h2 data-start=3D"6512" data-end=3D"6544">6. Bonnes pratiques =C3=A0 reteni=
r</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6546" data-end=3D"6971">
<li data-start=3D"6546" data-end=3D"6624">
<p data-start=3D"6548" data-end=3D"6624">Toujours choisir une convention ad=
apt=C3=A9e =C3=A0 la taille et =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99=C3=A9quipe du projet.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6625" data-end=3D"6662">
<p data-start=3D"6627" data-end=3D"6662">Documenter la m=C3=A9thodologie ch=
oisie.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6663" data-end=3D"6714">
<p data-start=3D"6665" data-end=3D"6714">=C3=8Atre rigoureux dans le nommag=
e et l=E2=80=99organisation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6715" data-end=3D"6796">
<p data-start=3D"6717" data-end=3D"6796">Utiliser des outils de linting CSS=
 (stylelint) configur=C3=A9s pour la m=C3=A9thodologie.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6797" data-end=3D"6861">
<p data-start=3D"6799" data-end=3D"6861">Pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9rer la modularit=C3=
=A9 et la r=C3=A9utilisabilit=C3=A9 =C3=A0 la duplication.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6862" data-end=3D"6931">
<p data-start=3D"6864" data-end=3D"6931">Combiner ces m=C3=A9thodologies si=
 n=C3=A9cessaire (par exemple BEM + OOCSS).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6932" data-end=3D"6971">
<p data-start=3D"6934" data-end=3D"6971">Penser =C3=A0 la maintenance =C3=
=A0 long terme.</p>
</li>
</ul>
