<hr data-start=3D"4278" data-end=3D"4281">
<h2 data-start=3D"4283" data-end=3D"4342">4. Quand et pourquoi la r=C3=A9p=
=C3=A9tition peut =C3=AAtre justifi=C3=A9e ?</h2>
<p data-start=3D"4344" data-end=3D"4445">M=C3=AAme si le DRY est un princip=
e cl=C3=A9, il y a des cas o=C3=B9 un peu de r=C3=A9p=C3=A9tition est tol=
=C3=A9r=C3=A9e, voire utile :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4447" data-end=3D"4916">
<li data-start=3D"4447" data-end=3D"4555">
<p data-start=3D"4449" data-end=3D"4555"><strong data-start=3D"4449" data-e=
nd=3D"4470">Lisibilit=C3=A9 locale</strong> : Parfois, r=C3=A9p=C3=A9ter un=
 style sp=C3=A9cifique am=C3=A9liore la clart=C3=A9 du CSS sans trop alourd=
ir.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4556" data-end=3D"4678">
<p data-start=3D"4558" data-end=3D"4678"><strong data-start=3D"4558" data-e=
nd=3D"4583">Overrides sp=C3=A9cifiques</strong> : Certains styles doivent =
=C3=AAtre diff=C3=A9rents, m=C3=AAme si proches, pour =C3=A9viter un coupla=
ge trop fort.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4679" data-end=3D"4793">
<p data-start=3D"4681" data-end=3D"4793"><strong data-start=3D"4681" data-e=
nd=3D"4713">Prototypes ou petits projets</strong> : Pour un projet tr=C3=A8=
s simple, imposer le DRY strict peut =C3=AAtre contre-productif.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4794" data-end=3D"4916">
<p data-start=3D"4796" data-end=3D"4916"><strong data-start=3D"4796" data-e=
nd=3D"4820">Performance critique</strong> : R=C3=A9duire les s=C3=A9lecteur=
s complexes et la d=C3=A9pendance aux h=C3=A9ritages pour =C3=A9viter un re=
ndu co=C3=BBteux.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4918" data-end=3D"4921">
<h2 data-start=3D"4923" data-end=3D"4991">5. Techniques avanc=C3=A9es pour =
ma=C3=AEtriser DRY et =C3=A9viter la r=C3=A9p=C3=A9tition</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"4993" data-end=3D"4996">
<h3 data-start=3D"4998" data-end=3D"5052">5.1. Modulariser son CSS (avec BE=
M, SMACSS, OOCSS)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5054" data-end=3D"5176">Les m=C3=A9thodologies que tu conn=
ais comme BEM favorisent la r=C3=A9utilisation et limitent la r=C3=A9p=C3=
=A9tition par un nommage rigoureux.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5178" data-end=3D"5181">
<h3 data-start=3D"5183" data-end=3D"5227">5.2. Utiliser les fonctions CSS m=
odernes</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5229" data-end=3D"5376">
<li data-start=3D"5229" data-end=3D"5281">
<p data-start=3D"5231" data-end=3D"5281"><strong data-start=3D"5231" data-e=
nd=3D"5243"><code data-start=3D"5233" data-end=3D"5241">calc()</code></stro=
ng> pour combiner valeurs sans dupliquer.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5282" data-end=3D"5325">
<p data-start=3D"5284" data-end=3D"5325"><strong data-start=3D"5284" data-e=
nd=3D"5295"><code data-start=3D"5286" data-end=3D"5293">var()</code></stron=
g> pour centraliser les valeurs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5326" data-end=3D"5376">
<p data-start=3D"5328" data-end=3D"5376"><strong data-start=3D"5328" data-e=
nd=3D"5341"><code data-start=3D"5330" data-end=3D"5339">clamp()</code></str=
ong> pour g=C3=A9rer des valeurs dynamiques.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5378" data-end=3D"5381">
<h3 data-start=3D"5383" data-end=3D"5425">5.3. Automatismes avec outils mod=
ernes</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5427" data-end=3D"5578">
<li data-start=3D"5427" data-end=3D"5474">
<p data-start=3D"5429" data-end=3D"5474"><strong data-start=3D"5429" data-e=
nd=3D"5442">Stylelint</strong> pour d=C3=A9tecter les duplications.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5475" data-end=3D"5511">
<p data-start=3D"5477" data-end=3D"5511"><strong data-start=3D"5477" data-e=
nd=3D"5488">PostCSS</strong> pour optimiser le CSS.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5512" data-end=3D"5578">
<p data-start=3D"5514" data-end=3D"5578"><strong data-start=3D"5514" data-e=
nd=3D"5527">CSS-in-JS</strong> dans certains frameworks pour partager les s=
tyles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
