<h3 data-start=3D"4962" data-end=3D"4980">7.2. Avantages</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4982" data-end=3D"5117">
<li data-start=3D"4982" data-end=3D"5004">
<p data-start=3D"4984" data-end=3D"5004">Organisation claire.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5005" data-end=3D"5055">
<p data-start=3D"5007" data-end=3D"5055">Facilite la maintenance et le trav=
ail en =C3=A9quipe.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5056" data-end=3D"5117">
<p data-start=3D"5058" data-end=3D"5117">Permet de r=C3=A9utiliser les comp=
osants dans plusieurs projets.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5119" data-end=3D"5149">7.3. Alternatives modernes</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5151" data-end=3D"5281">
<li data-start=3D"5151" data-end=3D"5281">
<p data-start=3D"5153" data-end=3D"5281">Utilisation de <code data-start=3D=
"5168" data-end=3D"5174">@use</code> et <code data-start=3D"5178" data-end=
=3D"5188">@forward</code> (depuis Dart Sass) qui remplacent <code data-star=
t=3D"5223" data-end=3D"5232">@import</code> pour une meilleure encapsulatio=
n des namespaces.</p>
</li>
</ul>
