<hr data-start=3D"6368" data-end=3D"6371">
<h2 data-start=3D"6373" data-end=3D"6422">9. Avantages et limites des pr=C3=
=A9processeurs CSS</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6424" data-end=3D"6442">9.1. Avantages</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6444" data-end=3D"6611">
<li data-start=3D"6444" data-end=3D"6479">
<p data-start=3D"6446" data-end=3D"6479">Syntaxe plus riche et expressive.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6480" data-end=3D"6504">
<p data-start=3D"6482" data-end=3D"6504">Modularisation facile.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6505" data-end=3D"6534">
<p data-start=3D"6507" data-end=3D"6534">R=C3=A9duction de la r=C3=A9p=C3=
=A9tition.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6535" data-end=3D"6559">
<p data-start=3D"6537" data-end=3D"6559">Code plus maintenable.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6560" data-end=3D"6611">
<p data-start=3D"6562" data-end=3D"6611">Fonctions avanc=C3=A9es, calculs, =
conditions, boucles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6613" data-end=3D"6629">9.2. Limites</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6631" data-end=3D"6873">
<li data-start=3D"6631" data-end=3D"6672">
<p data-start=3D"6633" data-end=3D"6672">Compilation n=C3=A9cessaire (ajout=
 d=E2=80=99=C3=A9tape).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6673" data-end=3D"6709">
<p data-start=3D"6675" data-end=3D"6709">Complexit=C3=A9 suppl=C3=A9mentair=
e =C3=A0 g=C3=A9rer.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6710" data-end=3D"6770">
<p data-start=3D"6712" data-end=3D"6770">Parfois surutilis=C3=A9, ce qui pe=
ut mener =C3=A0 du code compliqu=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6771" data-end=3D"6873">
<p data-start=3D"6773" data-end=3D"6873">Avec CSS moderne (variables, custo=
m properties, calc, etc.), certains usages peuvent =C3=AAtre remplac=C3=A9s=
.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6875" data-end=3D"6878">
<h2 data-start=3D"6880" data-end=3D"6897">10. Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6899" data-end=3D"7041">SASS / SCSS reste un outil puissan=
t et incontournable pour =C3=A9crire du CSS moderne, modulaire et maintenab=
le, surtout sur des projets complexes.</p>
