<li data-start=3D"887" data-end=3D"940">
<p data-start=3D"889" data-end=3D"940"><strong data-start=3D"889" data-end=
=3D"902">Reset.css</strong> : effacer tout pour repartir de z=C3=A9ro.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"941" data-end=3D"1010">
<p data-start=3D"943" data-end=3D"1010"><strong data-start=3D"943" data-end=
=3D"960">Normalize.css</strong> : harmoniser les diff=C3=A9rences sans tout=
