<h3 data-start=3D"2069" data-end=3D"2087">2.4. Avantages</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2089" data-end=3D"2213">
<li data-start=3D"2089" data-end=3D"2139">
<p data-start=3D"2091" data-end=3D"2139">Supprime les styles par d=C3=A9fau=
t =3D contr=C3=B4le total.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2140" data-end=3D"2213">
<p data-start=3D"2142" data-end=3D"2213">Parfait pour les designers qui veu=
lent <strong data-start=3D"2181" data-end=3D"2212">une base 100% personnali=
s=C3=A9e</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"2215" data-end=3D"2237">2.5. Inconv=C3=A9nients</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2239" data-end=3D"2470">
<li data-start=3D"2239" data-end=3D"2342">
<p data-start=3D"2241" data-end=3D"2342"><strong data-start=3D"2241" data-e=
nd=3D"2258">Supprime trop</strong> de comportements utiles (ex : styles de =
<code data-start=3D"2299" data-end=3D"2308">buttons</code>, <code data-star=
t=3D"2310" data-end=3D"2318">inputs</code>, <code data-start=3D"2320" data-=
end=3D"2328">tables</code>, <code data-start=3D"2330" data-end=3D"2340">hea=
dings</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2343" data-end=3D"2446">
<p data-start=3D"2345" data-end=3D"2446">N=C3=A9cessite de <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"2358" data-end=3D"2389">tout red=C3=A9finir manuellement</strong> (ex=
 : remettre des marges =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"2418" data-end=3D"2421">p=
</code>, des tailles =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"2437" data-end=3D"2441">h1<=
/code>...).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2447" data-end=3D"2470">
<p data-start=3D"2449" data-end=3D"2470">Moins "future-proof".</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2472" data-end=3D"2475">
<h2 data-start=3D"2477" data-end=3D"2529">3. Normalize.css : une harmonisat=
ion intelligente</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2531" data-end=3D"2550">3.1. D=C3=A9finition</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2552" data-end=3D"2690"><strong data-start=3D"2552" data-e=
nd=3D"2569">Normalize.css</strong> est un projet open source qui vise =C3=
=A0 <strong data-start=3D"2607" data-end=3D"2644">rendre le rendu CSS plus =
coh=C3=A9rent</strong> entre les navigateurs, <strong data-start=3D"2668" d=
ata-end=3D"2689">sans tout effacer</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2692" data-end=3D"2799">Cr=C3=A9=C3=A9 par <strong data-st=
art=3D"2701" data-end=3D"2722">Nicolas Gallagher</strong>, il <strong data-=
start=3D"2727" data-end=3D"2757">pr=C3=A9serve les styles utiles</strong>, =
et <strong data-start=3D"2762" data-end=3D"2790">corrige les incoh=C3=A9ren=
ces</strong> connues.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2801" data-end=3D"2818">3.2. Objectif</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2820" data-end=3D"3002">=E2=9E=A1=EF=B8=8F Appliquer des <=
