ng> et des <strong data-start=3D"2868" data-end=3D"2898">normalisations sp=
=C3=A9cifiques</strong> tout en <strong data-start=3D"2907" data-end=3D"295=
1">pr=C3=A9servant les styles s=C3=A9mantiques utiles</strong> (ex : les st=
yles de <code data-start=3D"2972" data-end=3D"2976">h1</code>, <code data-s=
tart=3D"2978" data-end=3D"2986">button</code>, <code data-start=3D"2988" da=
ta-end=3D"2994">form</code>, etc.).</p>
