<h3 data-start=3D"3348" data-end=3D"3366">3.4. Avantages</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3368" data-end=3D"3605">
<li data-start=3D"3368" data-end=3D"3411">
<p data-start=3D"3370" data-end=3D"3411">Conserve les comportements natifs =
utiles.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3412" data-end=3D"3473">
<p data-start=3D"3414" data-end=3D"3473">Moins destructif =3D moins de trav=
ail pour tout reconstruire.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3474" data-end=3D"3529">
<p data-start=3D"3476" data-end=3D"3529">Maintenu activement avec des mises=
 =C3=A0 jour fr=C3=A9quentes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3530" data-end=3D"3605">
<p data-start=3D"3532" data-end=3D"3605">Convient mieux aux projets <strong=
 data-start=3D"3559" data-end=3D"3574">accessibles</strong> et <strong data=
-start=3D"3578" data-end=3D"3604">compatibles navigateur</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3607" data-end=3D"3629">3.5. Inconv=C3=A9nients</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3631" data-end=3D"3775">
